window.GAME_DATA3 = {"prayers":[{"title":"Prayer for Connection","text":"Help me to connect deeply with others. May I build meaningful and loving relationships.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Reflection","text":"Guide me in moments of reflection. Help me to learn and grow from my experiences.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Intention","text":"Let my actions be guided by clear intentions. May I act with purpose and direction.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Protection","text":"Keep me and my loved ones safe from harm. Surround us with your protective embrace.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Compassion","text":"Open my heart to the suffering of others. May I act with compassion and empathy.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Union","text":"Bless us with a sense of union. May we work together harmoniously for the greater good.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Creation","text":"Inspire my creativity and innovation. Let me contribute positively to the world through my creations.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Revelation","text":"Bless me with revelation and insight. Help me to see the truth and understand your will.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Elevation","text":"Elevate my spirit and mind. Help me to rise above challenges and reach my highest potential.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Elation","text":"Fill my heart with elation and joy. Let me celebrate life's blessings with gratitude.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Cooperation","text":"Bless us with a spirit of cooperation. May we work together harmoniously for common goals.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Preservation","text":"Help us to preserve the beauty of the Earth. May we protect and cherish our natural world.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Restoration","text":"Restore my soul and spirit. Help me to find healing and renewal in your love.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Celebration","text":"Help me to celebrate life's blessings. Let me find joy and gratitude in every moment.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Dedication","text":"Grant me dedication in my pursuits. Help me to stay committed and focused on my goals.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Education","text":"Bless my journey of education. Help me to gain knowledge and wisdom in all I do.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Liberation","text":"Liberate me from fears and doubts. Help me to live freely and joyfully.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Meditation","text":"Guide me in moments of meditation. Help me to find peace and clarity within.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Inspiration","text":"Fill me with inspiration. Help me to create and contribute positively to the world.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Illumination","text":"Illuminate my mind and spirit. Help me to see clearly and understand deeply.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Motivation","text":"Grant me motivation to pursue my dreams. Help me to stay energized and focused.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Communication","text":"Bless my words and actions. Help me to communicate with clarity and kindness.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Reconciliation","text":"Guide me towards reconciliation. Help me to mend relationships and find peace.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer for Unification","text":"Unify our hearts and minds. Help us to work together in harmony and love.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."},{"title":"Prayer to My Guides","text":"Dear spirits, helpers and guides, thank you for your lovely companionship. I am so grateful for your wise and kind guidance. Bring me to the best occasions to serve the highest good. I give thanks for each message and gift. I love to walk this path with you.","how":"Speak it together – Barbara’s own prayer."},{"title":"The Golden Path Invocation","text":"I remember who I am. I am Light experiencing form. I am not separate. I am not alone. My heart is my compass. My choice is my power. My release is my freedom. Every step leads home. I spread my wings. I walk the Golden Path – and the Golden Path walks me home.","how":"Speak it together, hand on heart."}],"wings":[{"title":"Enjoy the Sunshine","text":"Let the sun light up your soul and enjoy the simple joys.","effect":"fly3","prompt":"Where do you want to fly in your life?"},{"title":"Balance Your Self","text":"Find harmony between head and heart. Take time for inner peace.","effect":"rest","prompt":"Where do you need more rest?"},{"title":"Go for a Walk","text":"A walk refreshes the mind and enlivens the body. Enjoy nature.","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"Be Creative","text":"Let your imagination run free and create something beautiful.","effect":"lucky","prompt":"Why does this number feel right?"},{"title":"Choose Your Lucky Number","text":"Find your lucky number. It brings orientation and positive energy.","effect":"lucky","prompt":"Why does this number feel right?"},{"title":"Hug Yourself and Hug Someone Else","text":"A hug gives comfort. Embrace yourself – and someone else.","effect":"bring","prompt":"Whom would you love to walk with?"},{"title":"Read an Empowering Book","text":"A good book can inspire. Choose a story that strengthens you.","effect":"insight","prompt":"What did you learn lately?"},{"title":"Take a Day Off","text":"Allow yourself a time-out to relax and recharge.","effect":"rest","prompt":"Where do you need more rest?"},{"title":"Use Your Voice","text":"Share your thoughts and feelings. Your voice is powerful.","effect":"again","prompt":"What wants another chance?"},{"title":"Enjoy an Energy Healing Session","text":"Let healing energy renew your spiritual powers.","effect":"energy","prompt":"What gives you energy?"},{"title":"Do Something New","text":"Try something new and discover unknown paths. Widen your horizon.","effect":"toGate","prompt":"Which gate is opening for you?"},{"title":"Share Your Bright Ideas","text":"Share your shining ideas with others. Inspiration can arise anywhere.","effect":"allForward","prompt":"What can we create together?"},{"title":"Change and Organize Your Thoughts","text":"Reorder your thoughts and find clarity. Change begins in the mind.","effect":"detour","prompt":"What looks different from here?"},{"title":"Create Your Space to Feel Enlightened","text":"Shape your space so you feel inspired and enlightened.","effect":"double","prompt":"What deserves your full power?"},{"title":"Enjoy Nature with Open Heart","text":"Open your heart and enjoy the wonders of nature. Feel the connection.","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"Gift Someone Around You","text":"Bring joy to someone with a little gift. Sharing enriches.","effect":"giftStep","prompt":"Whom can you help today?"},{"title":"Invite a Helping Hand","text":"Invite help and be ready to help others. Together you are strong.","effect":"meet","prompt":"What does this mean for you?"},{"title":"Write Down Your Dreams","text":"Write your dreams down and hold them. They are the key to your future.","effect":"key","prompt":"Which door is opening?"},{"title":"Be in Harmony","text":"Listen to harmonizing sounds. Music heals the soul.","effect":"music","prompt":"Which song carries you?"},{"title":"Listen to Your Gut Feeling","text":"Trust your gut feeling. Your inner wisdom knows the right way.","effect":"again","prompt":"What wants another chance?"},{"title":"Be Different","text":"Allow yourself to be different. Your uniqueness is your strength.","effect":"double","prompt":"What deserves your full power?"},{"title":"Do Something That Gives You Energy","text":"Find what fills you with energy and brings you to life.","effect":"fly3","prompt":"Where do you want to fly in your life?"},{"title":"Listen to Your Inner Voice","text":"Listen to your inner voice. It leads you to your true purpose.","effect":"lucky","prompt":"Why does this number feel right?"},{"title":"Act Out of Love","text":"Act out of love. Love is the strongest power in the universe.","effect":"giftStep","prompt":"Whom can you help today?"}],"signs":[{"title":"Cardinal","text":"A loved one is near and sends you greetings.","effect":"cardinal","prompt":"Who comes to your mind?"},{"title":"Ladybug","text":"Good luck is landing on you.","effect":"again","prompt":"What wants another chance?"},{"title":"Butterfly","text":"Transformation: you spread new wings.","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"Dragonfly","text":"Change and lightness – see through illusions.","effect":"detourLight","prompt":"What looks different from here?"},{"title":"Coin","text":"Abundance finds you in unexpected places.","effect":"coin","prompt":"Where is abundance in your life?"},{"title":"White Feather","text":"Your angels are close – they carry you forward.","effect":"toGate","prompt":"Which gate is opening for you?"},{"title":"Melody","text":"The music of the spheres plays for all of you.","effect":"music","prompt":"Which song carries you?"},{"title":"Heart-shaped Cloud","text":"Love is all around – look up!","effect":"allPearl","prompt":"What connects us all?"},{"title":"Cloud with a Rainbow","text":"After the rain comes hope.","effect":"key","prompt":"Which door is opening?"},{"title":"Dolphin","text":"Joy and play – dive into lightness.","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"Wolf","text":"Your pack walks with you.","effect":"pullUp","prompt":"Who could use your light?"},{"title":"Dog","text":"Loyal friendship: help a companion forward.","effect":"giftStep","prompt":"Whom can you help today?"},{"title":"Cat","text":"Rest like a cat – deep peace recharges you.","effect":"rest","prompt":"Where do you need more rest?"},{"title":"Turtle","text":"Slowly is also a pace. Be patient with yourself.","effect":"rest","prompt":"Where do you need more rest?"},{"title":"Number 7","text":"Lucky seven: choose your own steps.","effect":"lucky","prompt":"Why does this number feel right?"},{"title":"Number 11","text":"Master number 11: a gateway of light for everyone.","effect":"allForward","prompt":"What can we create together?"},{"title":"The Key","text":"A realization unlocks a new perspective. What insight is opening a new door for you?","effect":"insight","prompt":"What did you learn lately?"},{"title":"The Star","text":"Inspiration arrives unexpectedly. Offer someone in the circle a word of encouragement.","effect":"cardinal","prompt":"Who comes to your mind?"},{"title":"The Bridge Appears","text":"A moment of understanding builds a bridge. Where can you replace judgment with understanding?","effect":"swap","prompt":"How does the world look from their place?"},{"title":"The Hidden Melody","text":"A song finds you at the right moment. Listen – what is it telling you?","effect":"music","prompt":"Which song carries you?"}],"vibes":["Everything is passing – enjoy the NOW and focus on the light.","Choose a place that nurtures you and helps you recharge.","You are energy – and energy can change form.","Feel the energy of your future and walk your path courageously.","Be still, be in the moment, be with someone with full attention.","Step onto your next step with confidence.","Take care of yourself and follow your passion.","Thoughts become words, and words become action.","Break old patterns – create something great.","Live your life with joy and do something good every day.","I am whole, I am blessed, I am.","You are always connected to everyone and everything.","I am mind, body and spirit – all in one. I am unique.","I am courageous and move forward step by step on my path."],"numbers":[{"title":"111","text":"New beginnings! Your thoughts are seeds – plant a joyful one right now.","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"222","text":"Trust the timing. Everything is falling into place – together.","effect":"bring","prompt":"Whom would you love to walk with?"},{"title":"333","text":"Your helpers are near and cheer you on. Take a brave leap!","effect":"fly3","prompt":"Where do you want to fly in your life?"},{"title":"444","text":"You are protected and supported. Step forward with courage.","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"555","text":"Big change ahead – adventure is calling! Choose your own steps.","effect":"lucky","prompt":"Why does this number feel right?"},{"title":"777","text":"Lucky seven: you are on the right path. Fly to the next gate!","effect":"toGate","prompt":"Which gate is opening for you?"},{"title":"888","text":"Abundance flows. Share your treasure with someone on the path.","effect":"giftStep","prompt":"Whom can you help today?"},{"title":"999","text":"A cycle completes – let go with a smile and receive a key.","effect":"key","prompt":"Which door is opening?"},{"title":"11:11","text":"A gateway of light opens for everyone. Make a wish together!","effect":"allForward","prompt":"What can we create together?"},{"title":"22:22","text":"Master builder: you and a companion create something great.","effect":"cardinal","prompt":"Who comes to your mind?"},{"title":"Number 7","text":"Seven circuits, seven colours, seven keys – roll once more!","effect":"again","prompt":"What wants another chance?"},{"title":"Number 40","text":"Forty steps of wisdom. Every one counts – take two pearls.","effect":"coin","prompt":"Where is abundance in your life?"}],"messages":[{"title":"A Message from Your Guides","text":"Close your eyes. The first word that comes to you is a message. Say it aloud!","effect":"walk2","prompt":"What step are you ready to take?"},{"title":"Whisper of Spirit","text":"Someone you love sends greetings. Who comes to your mind? Smile at them.","effect":"cardinal","prompt":"Who comes to your mind?"},{"title":"The Inner Voice","text":"Ask your heart one question. Trust the very first answer – then move on.","effect":"lucky","prompt":"Why does this number feel right?"},{"title":"Gift of a Medium","text":"Look at a companion and share a kind message you feel for them.","effect":"giftStep","prompt":"Whom can you help today?"},{"title":"Dream Message","text":"Remember a dream that guided you. Share it and fly to the next gate.","effect":"toGate","prompt":"Which gate is opening for you?"},{"title":"Angel at Your Side","text":"An angel walks with you. Feel the wings – and fly three fields!","effect":"fly3","prompt":"Where do you want to fly in your life?"},{"title":"Ask for a Sign","text":"Ask the universe for a sign today. Everyone gets a pearl of trust.","effect":"allPearl","prompt":"What connects us all?"},{"title":"Synchronicity","text":"Coincidence? No – a message! Swap places with a companion if you both agree.","effect":"swap","prompt":"How does the world look from their place?"}],"bridge":[{"title":"A Loved One Says Hello","text":"Think of someone who has passed on. Feel their presence beside you – love never ends.","prompt":"What would they say to you today?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"The Bridge of Light","text":"Between here and there is a bridge of light. You can walk it with your heart.","prompt":"When did you feel connected to the other side?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Your Spirit Guide","text":"A guide walks with you – maybe an angel, an ancestor, a wise friend.","prompt":"How does your guide speak to you: feeling, image, word or sign?","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"The Feather Message","text":"A white feather lands before you. A message from the other side: you are not alone.","prompt":"What sign has comforted you before?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Listening Hands","text":"Hold the hands of the person next to you. Close your eyes for three breaths.","prompt":"What did you feel – warmth, tingling, peace?","effect":"bring"},{"title":"Clear Seeing","text":"Close your eyes. Let an image appear for the person on your left.","prompt":"Describe it – what might it mean for them?","effect":"giftStep"},{"title":"Clear Hearing","text":"Listen inside. A word, a song, a name arrives.","prompt":"Say it aloud. Does it mean something to anyone here?","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Clear Knowing","text":"Sometimes you simply know. Trust that inner knowing.","prompt":"What do you know deep down that you have not yet said?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"Dream Visit","text":"In dreams the veil is thin. Loved ones and guides come to visit.","prompt":"Which dream visit do you remember?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Grandmother's Wisdom","text":"The wisdom of your ancestors lives in you.","prompt":"Which family wisdom do you want to pass on?","effect":"key"},{"title":"The Golden Web","text":"All hearts – here and there – are connected in a golden web of light.","prompt":"Whom do you send love to right now?","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Thank You, Spirit","text":"Say thank you to all your unseen helpers. Gratitude opens the bridge.","prompt":"For which invisible help are you grateful?","effect":"music"}],"treasures":[{"title":"The Golden Key","text":"You found a golden key! It opens a door you did not see before.","prompt":"Which new door would you love to open?","effect":"key"},{"title":"A Shining Pearl","text":"In an old shell lies a pearl – wisdom from a hard moment.","prompt":"Which difficult time gave you your greatest pearl?","effect":"coin"},{"title":"The Treasure Map","text":"A map appears with a secret shortcut. Adventure!","prompt":"What adventure is calling you in life?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"A Sparkling Crystal","text":"A crystal glows in your hand and points the way to the next gate.","prompt":"Which quality do you want to grow now?","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"The Lantern","text":"A lantern lights the path for everyone behind you.","prompt":"Where can you be a light for others?","effect":"pullUp"},{"title":"The Compass","text":"Your inner compass shows true north. Choose your steps!","prompt":"What does your heart say is your next step?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"The Golden Chalice","text":"You drink from the golden chalice. Your cup overflows – share it!","prompt":"What fills your cup with joy?","effect":"giftStep"},{"title":"A Message in a Bottle","text":"A bottle washes ashore with a note: 'You are exactly where you need to be.'","prompt":"Write one encouraging sentence for the next player.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"The Magic Seed","text":"Plant this seed – a dream begins to grow.","prompt":"What dream are you planting today?","effect":"double"},{"title":"The Shared Treasure","text":"This treasure is too big for one. Everyone receives a pearl!","prompt":"What do you treasure about this circle?","effect":"allPearl"}],"chests":[{"title":"The Missed Bus","situation":"You run to the bus stop – and the bus drives away right in front of you.","good":"You breathe, look around and notice the sky turning pink.","others":["You complain to everyone that your day is ruined.","You blame yourself for being slow."],"joy":"A missed bus gave you five quiet minutes and a beautiful sky.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Rainy Saturday","situation":"You planned a picnic, but it is pouring with rain.","good":"You build a cozy blanket picnic at home with candles and music.","others":["You stay grumpy on the sofa all day.","You decide the weekend is wasted."],"joy":"Joy is not in the weather – it is in how you shape the moment.","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"The Ladybug","situation":"You are tired on a long walk and sit down on a stone.","good":"You notice a ladybug crawling on the stone beside you and smile.","others":["You only think about how far you still have to go.","You check your phone and miss everything around you."],"joy":"Small wonders wait on every stone – if we look.","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"After the Storm","situation":"A heavy storm has just passed. The streets are wet and grey.","good":"You look up – and there is a rainbow.","others":["You only see the puddles on your shoes.","You worry about the next storm."],"joy":"After the rain comes the rainbow – every time.","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"Morning Light","situation":"Your alarm rings. You feel heavy and want to stay in bed.","good":"You open the curtains and let the first sunbeams touch your face.","others":["You start the day by thinking about all your problems.","You scroll through bad news before getting up."],"joy":"A new morning is a new beginning – welcome it with light.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"A Stranger's Smile","situation":"You feel lonely in a busy supermarket queue.","good":"You smile at the person next to you – and they smile back.","others":["You look down and wait for it to be over.","You get annoyed that the queue is so slow."],"joy":"One smile can connect two hearts in a second.","effect":"bring"},{"title":"The Helping Hand","situation":"Your car breaks down on the side of the road. You feel helpless.","good":"You accept the help of a stranger who stops – and thank them warmly.","others":["You refuse help because you don't want to be a burden.","You panic and think nobody ever helps anyone."],"joy":"Help often comes when we dare to receive it.","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Broken Cup","situation":"Your favourite cup falls and breaks into pieces.","good":"You remember the lovely moments with it and plant a little flower in a piece.","others":["You get angry at yourself for the whole day.","You think 'everything always goes wrong for me'."],"joy":"Even something broken can become a new beginning.","effect":"key"},{"title":"The Lost Way","situation":"On holiday you take a wrong turn and get lost.","good":"You discover a hidden café and a friendly local who shows you the way.","others":["You argue with your travel companion.","You go back to the hotel and give up for the day."],"joy":"Detours lead to the most beautiful discoveries.","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"Cancelled Plans","situation":"A friend cancels your meeting at the last minute.","good":"You use the free evening for a bath, a book and some self-love.","others":["You feel rejected and unimportant.","You send an angry message."],"joy":"Free time is a gift you can give to yourself.","effect":"rest"},{"title":"The Mistake at Work","situation":"You made a mistake and your boss noticed.","good":"You own it, fix it, and learn something new.","others":["You hide it and feel anxious for days.","You decide you are simply not good enough."],"joy":"Every mistake is a teacher – and a pearl of wisdom.","effect":"coin"},{"title":"Waiting Room","situation":"You have to wait one hour at the doctor's.","good":"You start a kind chat with an elderly lady who tells you her life story.","others":["You count every minute and get more and more annoyed.","You read sad news on your phone."],"joy":"Every waiting room can become a meeting place.","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"The Grey Day","situation":"It is a grey November day and you feel low.","good":"You make a cup of tea, call a friend and light a candle.","others":["You stay in bed and think nothing will ever change.","You eat junk food and feel worse."],"joy":"Little lights make grey days golden.","effect":"energy"},{"title":"The Child's Question","situation":"A child asks you: 'Why is the sky blue?' You are in a hurry.","good":"You stop, kneel down and wonder about it together.","others":["You say 'not now' and walk on.","You give a quick answer without looking up."],"joy":"Curiosity shared is joy doubled.","effect":"double"},{"title":"A Song on the Radio","situation":"You are stuck in traffic and frustrated.","good":"Your favourite song comes on – you turn it up and sing along.","others":["You honk and get angry at the other drivers.","You tell yourself the whole day is a disaster."],"joy":"Music can turn a traffic jam into a concert.","effect":"music"},{"title":"The Old Friend","situation":"You see an old friend in the street you lost contact with.","good":"You walk up, hug them and say 'How wonderful to see you!'","others":["You pretend not to see them.","You feel guilty and cross the street."],"joy":"It is never too late to reconnect.","effect":"bring"},{"title":"The Garden","situation":"Your little plant seems to have died over the winter.","good":"You look closer and discover a tiny green bud.","others":["You throw it away immediately.","You decide you just can't grow anything."],"joy":"Life always finds a way back – look closely.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Feeling Not Good Enough","situation":"You compare yourself with someone who seems perfect.","good":"You remember three things you love about yourself.","others":["You decide you will never be like them.","You hide your talents so nobody can judge you."],"joy":"You are unique – your path is your own.","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"The Kind Neighbour","situation":"Your neighbour brings you soup when you are ill.","good":"You accept it with gratitude and later bring them flowers.","others":["You feel embarrassed and say you don't need it.","You wonder what they want in return."],"joy":"Kindness grows when we receive and give it.","effect":"giftStep"},{"title":"The Butterfly","situation":"You sit in the park, full of worries.","good":"A butterfly lands on your knee for a moment.","others":["You shoo it away and keep worrying.","You don't even notice it."],"joy":"Moments of grace come quietly – let them land.","effect":"sign"}],"moments":[{"title":"Racing Thoughts","mood":"Down","situation":"It is 3 a.m. Your thoughts run in circles and you can't sleep.","tool":"Put your hand on your heart. Breathe in for 4, out for 6. Write the thoughts on paper – they don't need to live in your head.","help":"Next morning, a friend sends you exactly the words you needed: 'It will be okay.'","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Fear Before a Big Step","mood":"Down","situation":"You have to give a talk tomorrow and fear grips your stomach.","tool":"Name the fear out loud. Then ask: what is the smallest brave step I can take?","help":"On the way, you see an advertisement: 'You've got this.' A sign just for you.","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"A Friendship Breaks","mood":"Down","situation":"A close friend is hurt by something you said. Silence grows between you.","tool":"Speak from the heart: 'I am sorry. You matter to me.' Listen without defending.","help":"Weeks later you meet by 'chance' in a café – and you hug.","effect":"bring"},{"title":"Feeling Alone","mood":"Down","situation":"Everyone seems busy. You feel invisible and alone.","tool":"Reach out first – one message, one call. Be kind to the lonely part of you.","help":"A stranger on the bus starts a warm conversation with you.","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Stress at Work","mood":"Down","situation":"Deadlines pile up. Your chest feels tight.","tool":"Stop for one minute. Drink water. Do one thing at a time – just the next one.","help":"A colleague offers: 'Can I help you with that?'","effect":"giftStep"},{"title":"Losing Your Way","mood":"Down","situation":"You don't know what you really want anymore.","tool":"Ask yourself: what made me happy as a child? Follow one tiny curiosity.","help":"A car in front of you has the plate '…777' – a smile and a feeling: keep going.","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"Anger Rising","mood":"Down","situation":"Someone treats you unfairly and anger burns inside.","tool":"Feel it, don't feed it. Move your body, breathe, and later speak clearly and calmly.","help":"A wise word on a poster: 'Respond, don't react.'","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"Grief","mood":"Down","situation":"You miss someone who is no longer here.","tool":"Let the tears flow – they are love. Light a candle and talk to them.","help":"A white feather lands at your feet. You know: love stays.","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Exam Nerves","mood":"Down","situation":"Your mind goes blank before an important test.","tool":"Ground yourself: feel your feet, name 5 things you see. Your knowledge is still there.","help":"Your teacher smiles at you – and suddenly you remember.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Money Worries","mood":"Down","situation":"The bills are higher than your income this month.","tool":"Write down what you DO have. Ask for advice – there is no shame in it.","help":"An old friend calls with a job offer – just at the right time.","effect":"coin"},{"title":"A Wave of Joy","mood":"Up","situation":"You passed! You did it! Your heart jumps.","tool":"Celebrate – and share your joy with someone who helped you.","help":"Everyone at the table cheers for you.","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Falling in Love with Life","mood":"Up","situation":"A perfect summer evening – music, friends, laughter.","tool":"Pause and say thank you. Store this moment in your heart for grey days.","help":"The sunset paints the sky in gold – a gift for everyone.","effect":"music"},{"title":"A New Friend","mood":"Up","situation":"At a course you meet someone who feels like an old soul friend.","tool":"Say yes to the connection. Invite them for a walk.","help":"You discover you share the same birthday – synchronicity!","effect":"bring"},{"title":"Overcoming Fear","mood":"Up","situation":"You did the thing you were afraid of – and survived!","tool":"Remember this feeling. It is proof: you are stronger than you think.","help":"A rainbow appears on your way home.","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Healing an Old Wound","mood":"Up","situation":"You finally forgive yourself for an old mistake.","tool":"Write a letter to your younger self – full of love.","help":"A song on the radio sings the exact words you wrote.","effect":"key"},{"title":"Panic on the Road","mood":"Down","situation":"Your car breaks down at night on a lonely road. Your heart races.","tool":"Breathe slowly. Ask for help – inside and out.","help":"A friendly truck driver stops – 'an angel in a hoodie' – and helps you.","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"Comparing Yourself","mood":"Down","situation":"Social media makes you feel you are not enough.","tool":"Close the app. Name three things you are proud of today.","help":"A child draws you a picture: 'For the best person.'","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Too Many Choices","mood":"Down","situation":"Two paths, both good – and you can't decide.","tool":"Imagine choosing one. Feel your body. Your heart already knows.","help":"You open a book at random – and read the answer.","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"A Second Chance","mood":"Up","situation":"The door you thought was closed opens again.","tool":"Walk through it with gratitude and with what you have learned.","help":"The number 11:11 shines on your clock as you say yes.","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Burnout Whisper","mood":"Down","situation":"You feel empty and tired – your cup is empty.","tool":"Rest is not weakness. Say no to one thing and yes to yourself.","help":"A neighbour leaves flowers at your door – 'just because'.","effect":"rest"}],"askHelp":["Your heart whispers: trust. You already know the next step.","In the stillness you hear it: be gentle with yourself.","The quiet voice says: you are not alone – support is near, even if you can't see it.","Your heart says: slow down. Power grows in stillness.","A feeling of warmth: say yes to what makes you feel light.","Your inner voice: let go of what is not yours to carry.","Listen… the answer may come later – as a sign, a word, a song.","Your heart says: courage. One small step is enough.","In the silence you feel it: you are loved, just as you are.","The subtle voice: share what you feel with someone you trust.","Your heart smiles: look for the little happiness today.","Stillness answers: everything is connected – and so are you."],"recharge":[{"title":"Breathe","text":"Three deep breaths. In through the nose, long out through the mouth."},{"title":"Walk","text":"Stand up and walk around the table once – feel your feet."},{"title":"Sing","text":"Sing one line of a song you love – loud or soft."},{"title":"Dance","text":"Shake your body for ten seconds – arms, shoulders, hips!"},{"title":"Journal","text":"Write one sentence: 'Right now I feel …'"},{"title":"Stretch","text":"Reach your arms to the sky, then let them fall like rain."},{"title":"Drink Water","text":"Take a sip of water and imagine it filling you with light."},{"title":"Smile","text":"Smile for ten seconds – even if it feels silly. Notice what changes."},{"title":"Create","text":"Draw a tiny symbol of how you feel on a piece of paper."},{"title":"Sunlight","text":"Close your eyes and imagine warm sunlight on your face."},{"title":"Hug","text":"Hug yourself – or someone who wants a hug."},{"title":"Nature","text":"Think of your favourite place in nature. Be there for a moment."},{"title":"Laugh","text":"Tell the funniest thing that happened to you this week."},{"title":"Rest","text":"Close your eyes and do nothing for ten seconds. Nothing at all."},{"title":"Music","text":"Hum a melody together with everyone at the table."},{"title":"Gratitude","text":"Name one small thing that gave you energy today."}],"numbers2":[{"n":0,"planet":"Pluto","keywords":"Transformation · depth · rebirth","text":"Zero is the source and the great transformation. What ends makes space for something new to be born.","prompt":"What in your life is ready to transform?","effect":"detour"},{"n":1,"planet":"Sun","keywords":"Energy · healing power · empowering others","text":"One is the sun: pure energy and healing power. Your light can empower others.","prompt":"Whom can you empower with your light today?","effect":"giftStep"},{"n":2,"planet":"Moon","keywords":"Emotions · mother · foresight · balance","text":"Two is the moon: emotions, the connection to the mother, foresight. Balance in life is important.","prompt":"Where do you need more balance right now?","effect":"rest"},{"n":3,"planet":"Mars","keywords":"Powerful force · bringing forward","text":"Three is Mars: an absolute powerful force that brings you forward. Sometimes it is too powerful – then one step back is given.","prompt":"Where do you need power – and where gentleness?","effect":"mars3"},{"n":4,"planet":"Mercury","keywords":"Ideas · bringing ideas into the world","text":"Four is Mercury: ideas! Bring your ideas into the world.","prompt":"Which idea wants to come into the world through you?","effect":"lucky"},{"n":5,"planet":"Faith","keywords":"Belief system · mind · luck","text":"Five is faith: your belief system, your mind – and luck.","prompt":"What do you truly believe about yourself?","effect":"again"},{"n":6,"planet":"Venus","keywords":"Love · friendship · care · grace","text":"Six is Venus: love, friendship, care, grace and connection.","prompt":"Who is a true friend on your path?","effect":"bring"},{"n":7,"planet":"Saturn","keywords":"Cause & effect · step by step · grounding","text":"Seven is Saturn: cause and effect. Stay strong and move forward step by step. You can help ground others.","prompt":"Whom can you help to feel grounded?","effect":"pullUp"},{"n":8,"planet":"Uranus","keywords":"Family · rebellion · sudden change","text":"Eight is Uranus: family, the rebel – changes from one moment to the next are possible.","prompt":"Which change surprised you – and became a gift?","effect":"swap"},{"n":9,"planet":"Jupiter","keywords":"Communication · companionship · voice","text":"Nine is Jupiter: communication, companionship, your voice.","prompt":"What do you want to say with your voice?","effect":"allPearl"},{"n":10,"planet":"Medium","keywords":"Bridge between here and there · antenna","text":"Ten is the medium: a bridge between here and there, an antenna for subtle messages.","prompt":"What message have you received lately?","effect":"bridgeCard"}],"radiate":[{"title":"Be Content","quality":"Contentment","text":"Your light shines brightest when you are at peace with what is. Contentment is quiet joy.","prompt":"What are you content with right now – just as it is?","affirmation":"I have enough. I am enough."},{"title":"Be Steady","quality":"Steadiness","text":"Like the sun rising every morning, your light grows through steady, loving steps.","prompt":"Where can you stay steady, even when life moves fast?","affirmation":"Step by step, I shine."},{"title":"Be Honest","quality":"Honesty","text":"Truth makes your light clear. When words, thoughts and actions are one, you radiate.","prompt":"Where can you be a little more honest – with yourself or others?","affirmation":"My truth is my light."},{"title":"Be Loving","quality":"Love","text":"Love is the highest frequency. Every loving thought makes your light grow.","prompt":"Whom can you send love to right now – including yourself?","affirmation":"Love flows through me."},{"title":"Be Caring","quality":"Care","text":"Caring for others and for yourself fills your light from inside.","prompt":"How can you care for someone – or for yourself – today?","affirmation":"I care, and I am cared for."},{"title":"Reflect","quality":"Reflection","text":"Reflection turns every step into wisdom. Look back with love, look forward with trust.","prompt":"What has this journey shown you so far?","affirmation":"I reflect, I learn, I shine."},{"title":"Be Grateful","quality":"Gratitude","text":"Gratitude lifts your energy instantly – like opening a window to the sun.","prompt":"Name three things you are grateful for in this moment.","affirmation":"Thank you, life."},{"title":"Be Present","quality":"Presence","text":"Your light shines in the now. Be fully here – with this breath, these people.","prompt":"What do you notice right now with all your senses?","affirmation":"I am here. I am light."},{"title":"Be Kind","quality":"Kindness","text":"A kind word is light you give away – and it returns doubled.","prompt":"What kind word can you give someone at this table?","affirmation":"Kindness is my nature."},{"title":"Be Joyful","quality":"Joy","text":"Joy is your soul dancing. Let it shine through your eyes and your smile.","prompt":"What makes your heart dance?","affirmation":"Joy radiates from me."},{"title":"Be Forgiving","quality":"Forgiveness","text":"Forgiveness frees your light from heavy clouds.","prompt":"What or whom are you ready to forgive – maybe yourself?","affirmation":"I let go and shine free."},{"title":"Be Yourself","quality":"Authenticity","text":"Your own light is unique. No one can shine like you.","prompt":"When do you feel most like yourself?","affirmation":"I shine as who I am."}],"communication":[{"title":"Said & Heard","exercise":"Say one sentence about your day to the person on your left. They repeat what they heard – in their own words.","question":"Was it the same? What got lost or added?"},{"title":"What Do You Need?","exercise":"Ask the person on your right: 'What do you need right now?' Just listen. Don't fix, don't advise.","question":"How did it feel to be truly heard?"},{"title":"The Clear Wish","exercise":"Say one wish to the circle – short, kind and clear. Begin with 'I would like …'","question":"Was it clear and obvious? What made it clear?"},{"title":"Mirror the Feeling","exercise":"Someone shares a small worry. You answer only: 'It sounds like you feel …'","question":"Did you name the feeling correctly?"},{"title":"Ten Words","exercise":"Explain what 'home' means to you in exactly ten words.","question":"Did the others understand you? What was hard?"},{"title":"Ask Before You Assume","exercise":"Think of a moment someone misunderstood you. Tell it in two sentences.","question":"What one question would have prevented the misunderstanding?"},{"title":"Kind & Honest","exercise":"Tell someone at the table one honest thing you appreciate – clearly and kindly.","question":"How does clear kindness feel to give and to receive?"},{"title":"The Silent Message","exercise":"Say something to a companion only with your face and hands – no words. They guess.","question":"What did they hear without words?"},{"title":"Listen With Your Heart","exercise":"Close your eyes. One person speaks for 30 seconds. Everyone else only listens.","question":"What did you hear between the words?"},{"title":"I-Message","exercise":"Turn a complaint into an I-message: 'I feel … when … because … I need …'","question":"How does it change the way the message lands?"},{"title":"Check In","exercise":"Ask your neighbour: 'Did I understand you right? You mean …?'","question":"Why is checking in a gift for both?"},{"title":"Clear No, Warm Heart","exercise":"Practise saying a clear, kind 'No, thank you' – with a smile.","question":"Can a clear no also be loving?"},{"title":"One Level Deeper","exercise":"Before your words form in your mouth, drop one level deeper – into your heart. Now say one sentence to someone at the table, filled with love.","question":"How did it feel to speak from the heart?"}],"held":[{"theme":"Guided","word":"Thy word is a lamp unto my feet, and a light unto my path.","ref":"Psalm 119:105","affirmation":"My path is lit, step by step."},{"theme":"Held","word":"The eternal God is thy refuge, and underneath are the everlasting arms.","ref":"Deuteronomy 33:27","affirmation":"I am held."},{"theme":"Protected","word":"He shall give his angels charge over thee, to keep thee in all thy ways.","ref":"Psalm 91:11","affirmation":"Angels walk with me."},{"theme":"Never alone","word":"I will never leave thee, nor forsake thee.","ref":"Hebrews 13:5","affirmation":"I am never alone."},{"theme":"Without fear","word":"Fear thou not; for I am with thee.","ref":"Isaiah 41:10","affirmation":"I let go of fear."},{"theme":"Calm","word":"Be still, and know that I am God.","ref":"Psalm 46:10","affirmation":"In stillness I know."},{"theme":"Cared for","word":"The Lord is my shepherd; I shall not want.","ref":"Psalm 23:1","affirmation":"I have all I need."},{"theme":"Directed","word":"In all thy ways acknowledge him, and he shall direct thy paths.","ref":"Proverbs 3:6","affirmation":"My paths are directed."},{"theme":"Rested","word":"Come unto me, all ye that labour and are heavy laden, and I will give you rest.","ref":"Matthew 11:28","affirmation":"I may rest."},{"theme":"Answered","word":"Ask, and it shall be given you; seek, and ye shall find.","ref":"Matthew 7:7","affirmation":"I ask, I seek, I find."},{"theme":"Shining","word":"Ye are the light of the world.","ref":"Matthew 5:14","affirmation":"I am light."},{"theme":"Comforted","word":"Weeping may endure for a night, but joy cometh in the morning.","ref":"Psalm 30:5","affirmation":"Joy comes in the morning."},{"theme":"Strengthened","word":"I can do all things through Christ which strengtheneth me.","ref":"Philippians 4:13","affirmation":"I am strengthened."},{"theme":"At peace","word":"Peace I leave with you, my peace I give unto you.","ref":"John 14:27","affirmation":"Peace is given to me."},{"theme":"Embraced","word":"Love never fails.","ref":"1 Corinthians 13:8","affirmation":"I am embraced by love."},{"theme":"Accompanied","word":"Lo, I am with you alway, even unto the end of the world.","ref":"Matthew 28:20","affirmation":"I am accompanied always."}],"song":{"title":"Let the Game Begin","author":"Barbara Prinz","chorus":"Let the game begin, one step, one light,\nI’m listening within as I walk through the night,\nno rush, just presence, I’m ready to see,\nguided by love, I become all of me.","moments":{"start":"Let the game begin, one step, one light, / I’m listening within as I walk through the night.","gate":"Every new question, every invisible door, / leads me to places I’ve not been before.","silence":"In rivers of silence and oceans of grace, / I gather my pieces and soften my pace.","choice":"One step at a time, one breath, one choice, / I balance my heart and I follow that voice.","cards":"Cards on the table, truth in my hand, / nothing is certain, not all has been planned.","trust":"Soft tone whispering: trust what you can’t see, / the unknown is here to set you free.","gratitude":"I breathe in the wonder, release all control, / let gratitude anchor the rise in my soul.","slow":"I’m drawn to the center, I feel and I know, / the only way forward is gently and slow.","role":"Life is a stage and I’m choosing my role, / softly I enter, awakening my soul.","parts":"One part the dreamer, one part the guide, / one part an observer, so quiet inside.","emerald":"Through emerald hallways my heartbeat slows, / I let go of stories that nobody knows.","heart":"I trust my journey, surrendered and free, / one conscious step into all I can be.","end":"One step, one breath, one heart, it sings, / smiling, I whisper, “Let the game begin.”"}},"song2":{"title":"The Game","intro":"Welcome, traveler.\n\nSome say life is a game…\na winding path of choices, chances, and hidden doors.\n\nWe roll the dice of courage.\nWe pass through gates of wonder.\nWe meet companions who carry pieces of our story.\n\nYet the deeper we walk the spiral,\nthe more we begin to remember…\n\nThis game was never meant to be won.\nIt was meant to be lived.\n\nAnd somewhere along the path,\nin the quiet chamber of the heart,\nthe greatest secret waits to be discovered:\n\nThe treasure was always within you.\n\nSo take your place at the board…\nand let the game begin.","moments":{"gate":["Some gates ask courage to step through, / some ask us simply just to see.","Every question, every sign, / every gate we wander through… / is just another gentle step / toward the heart that calls to you."],"companion":["We meet companions on the way, / some stay awhile, some disappear, / each one holds a little key / to something sacred waiting here."],"silence":["Wisdom grows in silent rooms / where we become more fully free."],"dice":["You take a step, you roll the dice, / some roads are bright, some hard to see, / but every turn reveals a clue / about the one you’re meant to be."],"trust":["The turns were never chance at all, / the path was always guiding you…"],"heart":["And when we reach the hidden room / where quiet light begins to rise, / we laugh to see what we became / while walking through the great disguise."],"end":["The game was just a sacred way / for love to rediscover you.","Walk the path… unlock the heart."]}},"helping":[{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Mentor","text":"Someone with wisdom and experience appears and shows you the next step.","prompt":"Who has been a mentor in your life?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Coach","text":"A coach helps you over an emotional hurdle – you don't have to do it alone.","prompt":"Which hurdle would you love help with?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Teacher","text":"A teacher shares knowledge that opens your eyes.","prompt":"What is the best thing a teacher gave you?","effect":"insight"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Volunteer","text":"Someone helps you selflessly – just because.","prompt":"When did you help someone without expecting anything?","effect":"giftStep"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Parent","text":"A parent's love supports you to grow and learn.","prompt":"What did your parents or elders give you for your path?","effect":"bring"},{"kind":"Helping Words","title":"“I believe in you!”","text":"A friend says the words you needed to hear.","prompt":"Say “I believe in you!” to someone at the table.","effect":"cardinal"},{"kind":"Helping Words","title":"“Well done!”","text":"Praise and recognition lift you up.","prompt":"For what can you say “Well done!” to yourself today?","effect":"coin"},{"kind":"Helping Words","title":"Words of Wisdom","text":"“What you sow today, you may harvest tomorrow.”","prompt":"What are you sowing right now?","effect":"double"},{"kind":"Helping Music","title":"A Song That Lifts You","text":"A song with a positive message lifts your whole mood.","prompt":"Which song makes you feel you can do anything?","effect":"music"},{"kind":"Helping Music","title":"A Childhood Song","text":"A song from your childhood brings back warm memories.","prompt":"Hum a song from your childhood.","effect":"allPearl"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"The Angel","text":"A symbol of protection and guidance watches over you.","prompt":"Where do you feel protected?","effect":"toGate"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"The Star","text":"A star – hope, guidance, endless possibilities.","prompt":"Which star guides you?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"The Key","text":"A key – a solution, a discovery, a door that opens.","prompt":"Which door would you love to open?","effect":"key"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"The Bees","text":"Bees – cooperation and community. Together you are strong.","prompt":"What can this circle create together?","effect":"allForward"},{"kind":"Helping Doors","title":"A New Beginning","text":"A door opens to a fresh new chapter. Walk 3 steps forward!","prompt":"What new chapter is calling you?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Helping Doors","title":"A Second Chance","text":"A miracle happens – you receive a second chance.","prompt":"Where would you love a second chance?","effect":"again"},{"kind":"Helping Doors","title":"A New Friendship","text":"A door opens to a new friendship that brings support.","prompt":"Whom would you love to get to know better?","effect":"bring"},{"kind":"Helping Doors","title":"The Door of Possibilities","text":"The journey continues – step through the door of possibilities.","prompt":"Which possibility excites you?","effect":"lucky"},{"kind":"Helping Nature","title":"Sunrise","text":"A sunrise fills you with fresh energy.","prompt":"When did you last watch the sun rise?","effect":"energy"},{"kind":"Helping Nature","title":"Silence of the Forest","text":"The quiet of the forest calms your mind.","prompt":"Where in nature do you find peace?","effect":"rest"},{"kind":"Helping Challenges","title":"The Mountain Path","text":"A steep path leads to your goal – and makes you stronger.","prompt":"Which challenge made you stronger?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Helping Dreams","title":"Your Dream Is Calling","text":"Your dreams are within reach – take the first step today.","prompt":"What is one small step toward your dream?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"A Stranger Crossing Your Path","text":"Someone you have never met says exactly the right thing.","prompt":"Has a stranger ever helped you?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Neighbour","text":"A neighbour knocks with a smile – help can live right next door.","prompt":"How could you help a neighbour this week?","effect":"bring"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Store Worker","text":"A kind word at the checkout brightens the whole day.","prompt":"Thank someone who serves you today.","effect":"cardinal"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"Partner, Family, Friends","text":"The people closest to you carry you when you are tired.","prompt":"Who carries you – and whom do you carry?","effect":"allPearl"},{"kind":"Helping Hand","title":"The Colleague","text":"A colleague helps you out – work becomes teamwork.","prompt":"Who makes your workday lighter?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Helping Words","title":"Words on a Shirt","text":"A slogan on a stranger’s shirt answers the question in your head.","prompt":"What catches your eye today?","effect":"insight"},{"kind":"Helping Words","title":"An Advertisement","text":"A sign on the street speaks to you as if it was meant for you.","prompt":"Have you ever read the right words at the right time?","effect":"lucky"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"A Book Falls Open","text":"A book opens at exactly the page you needed.","prompt":"Open any book nearby – read one line aloud!","effect":"insight"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"Flowers and Trees","text":"A flower in the crack of the pavement, an old tree – nature speaks.","prompt":"Which tree or flower is special to you?","effect":"energy"},{"kind":"Helping Symbols","title":"Numbers","text":"The same numbers keep appearing – 11:11, 333 – a little wink from the universe.","prompt":"Which numbers keep following you?","effect":"lucky"},{"kind":"Helping Doors","title":"A Gift You Receive","text":"Out of nowhere, a little gift arrives – just for you.","prompt":"What is the most surprising gift you have received?","effect":"coin"},{"kind":"Helping Doors","title":"A Miracle Unfolds","text":"Things fall into place in a way you could never have planned.","prompt":"Share a small miracle from your life.","effect":"fly3"}],"dreams":["Your dreams are within reach – take the first step today.","Believe in your vision, the universe is listening.","The road may be long, but your destination is worth the journey.","You are capable of more than you realize.","Each small action brings you closer to your dream.","Trust the process, your dreams are unfolding perfectly.","The seeds you plant today will blossom tomorrow.","Take a leap of faith – the net will appear.","Every setback is a setup for a comeback.","Dream big, start small, act now.","The dream you are chasing is already chasing you.","Let go of fear; your dreams are waiting on the other side.","Your dream is the path to your true self – follow it.","Trust your intuition – it’s guiding you to your dreams.","Dreams don’t have deadlines – there’s always time to begin.","Dare to dream without limits.","Your dreams are the whispers of your soul – listen closely.","You are a creator of your own destiny – don’t be afraid to dream.","Step out of your comfort zone – that’s where the dreams live."],"song3":{"title":"We’re on a Golden Path","credit":"© 2026 Barb&Heart&Soul&Medium","chorus":"We’re on a golden path\nwith a golden heart,\nChildren of one Sun,\nLight from the start.","moments":{"silence":["A whisper in the silence rising from within: “Be still and listen, child.”"],"slow":["“Be still and listen, child.”"],"trust":["A golden thread inside my chest / pulling gently through the night, / saying, “You were never separate, / you are made of light.”"],"companion":["Consciousness is connection, / a soft return to One, / not a wall between our hearts / but a bridge into the Sun."],"prayer":["Prayer is communication / with the highest Source of all, / not begging at a closed door / but answering a call."],"radiate":["God is light within our being, / radiating out from everyone."],"gate":["Rays of love, no distinction, / every soul, every one, / we are children of the same / everlasting Sun."],"heart":["We are constantly connected, / we’re never really gone, / we forgot, but we remember / we’ve been golden all along."],"end":["Coming back, coming back, / to our deepest heart connection. / Golden thread, golden path, / love in every direction."]}},"film":[{"title":"You Are the Director","text":"You are the producer, director, author and actor of this film – the game of your lifelong journey.","prompt":"Who do you want to be in the next scene?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"The Most Important Part","text":"Make the best out of every single scene – you can be the most important part of this amazing story.","prompt":"Which scene of your life are you proud of?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Co-Creating","text":"Whatever happens, you are co-creating together with life and the people around you.","prompt":"Who is co-creating your story with you right now?","effect":"bring"},{"title":"Your Message","text":"Every story carries a message into the world.","prompt":"What do you want to bring out into the world?","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"Feel Your Life","text":"Different emotions, different feelings – live them through. Then decide what they mean to you.","prompt":"Is this feeling uplifting? Is it helping you to get better?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Heal Your Wounds","text":"Heal your wounds by taking care of yourself. It is your responsibility – and your choice.","prompt":"What is one loving thing you can do for yourself today?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Back on Your Path","text":"It is always possible to step back onto your path – your unique way in life.","prompt":"Where would you love to return to your path?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Mind–Heart Connection","text":"When mind and heart work together, your steps become clear and strong.","prompt":"What does your mind say – and what does your heart say?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"More Than Time","text":"Time isn't the only thing that matters. The most you can make of your life are the connections you build.","prompt":"Which connection do you want to nourish?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Orchestrated Moments","text":"Many moments are orchestrated, many steps are your own actions – together they write your story.","prompt":"Which 'coincidence' changed your life?","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Grow Your Power","text":"Use your human life to grow, to learn, to build your own power.","prompt":"What have you learned this year that made you stronger?","effect":"key"},{"title":"A Unique Conversation","text":"No one else can have the conversation you are having right now. Your life makes it unique.","prompt":"What can you say today that only you can say?","effect":"giftStep"}],"elevator":[{"n":1,"title":"Lift Me Up","text":"Someone believes in you – and you feel yourself rising.","affirmation":"I allow myself to be lifted.","effect":"lift5"},{"n":2,"title":"You Are Unique","text":"No one has ever walked your path before. That makes you special.","affirmation":"I am unique and special.","effect":"fly3"},{"n":3,"title":"Rise Above","text":"Look at your worries from above – they become small, and your path becomes clear.","affirmation":"I rise above.","effect":"toGate"},{"n":4,"title":"Your Inner Power","text":"Empowerment is remembering the power that was always inside you.","affirmation":"I am powerful.","effect":"lift5"},{"n":5,"title":"Wings of Courage","text":"Courage lifts you to the next level of your life.","affirmation":"I dare to fly.","effect":"fly3"},{"n":6,"title":"Lifted by Love","text":"Love is the strongest elevator – it carries you higher than anything else.","affirmation":"Love lifts me.","effect":"lift5"},{"n":7,"title":"Golden Moment","text":"This is your moment. Shine – and lift others with you.","affirmation":"I shine and lift others.","effect":"liftAll"},{"n":8,"title":"Next Level","text":"You have grown. The doors to the next level open now.","affirmation":"I am ready for the next level.","effect":"toGate"},{"n":9,"title":"Believe in Yourself","text":"When you believe in yourself, the whole universe lifts you up.","affirmation":"I believe in me.","effect":"lift5"},{"n":10,"title":"Elevator to the Light","text":"The doors open – golden light everywhere. You are lifted toward the heart.","affirmation":"I am lifted into the light.","effect":"lift7"}],"babysteps":["Breathe in … and out.","Smile.","Look up for a moment.","Wiggle your toes.","Say “thank you” quietly.","Roll your shoulders.","Notice one colour around you.","Put your hand on your heart.","Take a sip of water.","Listen to the sounds around you.","Think of someone you love.","Stretch your arms.","Close your eyes for three seconds.","Feel your feet on the ground.","Say one kind word to yourself.","Blink slowly and relax your face.","Hum one note.","Remember a happy moment.","Notice your breath.","Give someone a smile.","Unclench your jaw.","Feel the warmth of your hands.","Think: “I am on my path.”","Count three things you can see.","Let your shoulders drop.","Whisper: “one step, one light.”","Look at the person next to you – with kindness.","Feel gratitude for this moment.","Shake out your hands.","Sit up tall like a tree.","Think of the sun on your face.","Name today’s little happiness.","Breathe into your belly.","Say “yes” to life.","Imagine a golden thread in your chest.","Rest – nothing to do.","Notice something beautiful.","Send a wish to the Golden Heart.","Smile at yourself inside.","You are here. That is enough."],"journeys":[{"id":"forest","icon":"🌲","title":"The Forest Path","color":"#2f8f5b","intro":"Tall trees, soft moss, birdsong. The path winds deeper into the green.","scenes":[{"text":"Sunlight falls through the leaves like golden rain.","q":"Breathe in deeply – what does the forest smell like for you?"},{"text":"An old tree stands in a clearing. Place your hand on its bark.","q":"What would this wise tree tell you about patience?"},{"text":"A little stream crosses the path. Hop over the stones.","q":"What do you want to leave behind in the water?"}],"gift":"An acorn of patience","giftText":"Big things grow from small seeds."},{"id":"cave","icon":"🕯","title":"The Crystal Cave","color":"#7d4fb3","intro":"A narrow entrance in the rock. Inside, crystals glow in every colour.","scenes":[{"text":"It is dark at first. Your eyes slowly get used to it.","q":"What helps you when life feels dark?"},{"text":"A violet amethyst shines brighter as you come closer.","q":"Which quality wants to shine in you right now?"},{"text":"In the heart of the cave is a silent lake that mirrors the crystals.","q":"Look into the mirror – what beauty do you see in yourself?"}],"gift":"A glowing crystal","giftText":"Your inner light always finds a way."},{"id":"mountain","icon":"⛰","title":"The Mountain Summit","color":"#5a7ab8","intro":"A steep trail leads up into the clouds.","scenes":[{"text":"Each step is heavy, but the view keeps getting wider.","q":"What challenge are you climbing right now?"},{"text":"A fellow traveller offers you water and a smile.","q":"Who has given you strength on your way up?"},{"text":"At the top the whole world lies below you.","q":"From up here – what really matters in your life?"}],"gift":"An eagle feather","giftText":"Rise above and see the bigger picture."},{"id":"ocean","icon":"🌊","title":"The Ocean Shore","color":"#2849a8","intro":"Waves roll in and out. Salt air, endless blue.","scenes":[{"text":"You walk barefoot in the sand. The waves wash over your feet.","q":"What would you love to let flow in your life?"},{"text":"A shell lies in front of you. Inside – a tiny pearl.","q":"Which hard moment gave you a pearl of wisdom?"},{"text":"The sun sets and paints the sea in gold.","q":"For what are you grateful today?"}],"gift":"A pearl from the sea","giftText":"Every wave brings something new."},{"id":"stars","icon":"✨","title":"Journey to the Stars","color":"#3b2f7a","intro":"A portal of light opens. You float into another dimension, among the stars.","scenes":[{"text":"You are weightless. Galaxies sparkle around you.","q":"How does it feel to be part of something so big?"},{"text":"A star speaks to you in a soft voice: “You are made of light.”","q":"What does your soul want you to remember?"},{"text":"You see the Earth – small, blue and beautiful.","q":"What wish do you send to our planet?"}],"gift":"A piece of stardust","giftText":"You are made of light."},{"id":"garden","icon":"🌸","title":"The Enchanted Garden","color":"#d9708a","intro":"A hidden gate opens to a garden full of flowers and butterflies.","scenes":[{"text":"Flowers of every colour bow gently in the wind.","q":"Which flower would you be – and why?"},{"text":"A butterfly lands on your hand for a long moment.","q":"What in your life is transforming right now?"},{"text":"In the middle stands a fountain of clear water.","q":"What would you love to bloom in the coming months?"}],"gift":"A magic seed","giftText":"What you water, grows."},{"id":"desert","icon":"🏜","title":"The Desert of Silence","color":"#c98a2e","intro":"Golden dunes as far as the eye can see. Wide sky, deep silence.","scenes":[{"text":"Only the wind and your footsteps. Nothing else.","q":"What do you hear when everything is quiet?"},{"text":"At night a sky full of stars appears – brighter than anywhere.","q":"Which star guides you?"},{"text":"You find an oasis with palms and fresh water.","q":"What refreshes your soul when you feel dry?"}],"gift":"A golden grain of sand","giftText":"In silence lies great strength."},{"id":"waterfall","icon":"💧","title":"The Hidden Waterfall","color":"#2bb3b1","intro":"Behind green ferns you hear rushing water.","scenes":[{"text":"The waterfall sparkles in the sun – a rainbow dances in the mist.","q":"Where have you seen a rainbow after rain in your life?"},{"text":"You step under the water. It washes away everything heavy.","q":"What are you ready to wash away?"},{"text":"Behind the waterfall is a secret cave with a warm light.","q":"What secret treasure lies hidden behind your fears?"}],"gift":"A drop of living water","giftText":"You are cleansed and renewed."},{"id":"temple","icon":"🏛","title":"The Temple of Light","color":"#e6c463","intro":"White stairs lead to an ancient temple glowing in the sunset.","scenes":[{"text":"At the door, a wise keeper greets you with a bow.","q":"What question would you ask the keeper?"},{"text":"Inside, a single candle burns in the silence.","q":"What do you pray for – for yourself and others?"},{"text":"On the wall you read: “Know thyself.”","q":"What have you learned about yourself on this path?"}],"gift":"A blessing of light","giftText":"You carry the temple within you."},{"id":"village","icon":"🏡","title":"The Village of Friends","color":"#e2702a","intro":"Colourful houses, music and the smell of fresh bread.","scenes":[{"text":"Children play and invite you to join their game.","q":"When did you last play like a child?"},{"text":"An old woman shares her bread and a story with you.","q":"What story from your life would you share?"},{"text":"In the evening everyone dances around a fire.","q":"Who would you love to celebrate with?"}],"gift":"A friendship bracelet","giftText":"Joy shared is joy doubled."},{"id":"river","icon":"🏞","title":"The Flowing River","color":"#2a8ab0","intro":"Jump into the river! The water carries you gently – no beginning, no end.","scenes":[{"text":"You float on your back and look at the sky. The river knows the way.","q":"Where in your life can you stop swimming against the current?"},{"text":"The river flows around a big stone without any fight.","q":"Which obstacle could you simply flow around?"},{"text":"Other swimmers join you, laughing. You drift together for a while.","q":"Who flows through life with you?"}],"gift":"A drop of flow","giftText":"Trust and go with the flow."},{"id":"coast","icon":"🪨","title":"The Stony Coast","color":"#7a8a9a","intro":"Wind, waves and grey stones. You jump from rock to rock along the coast.","scenes":[{"text":"A wave splashes over your feet – cold and fresh! You laugh out loud.","q":"What wakes you up and makes you feel alive?"},{"text":"Between the stones you find a tiny pool full of life.","q":"What small wonder have you overlooked lately?"},{"text":"The wind is strong, but your feet stand firm on the rock.","q":"What keeps you steady when life gets stormy?"}],"gift":"A smooth stone of steadiness","giftText":"You stand firm – and still feel the wind."},{"id":"deep","icon":"🐚","title":"The Hidden World","color":"#1e5a8a","intro":"You dive deep into the ocean. Below the waves a hidden world of light and colour opens up.","scenes":[{"text":"Glowing fish swim around you. You can breathe easily here.","q":"What hidden gift lies deep inside you?"},{"text":"A gentle sea turtle swims beside you and shows you the way.","q":"Who calms, protects and supports you?"},{"text":"In a shell you find a shining pearl.","q":"Which pearl of wisdom did you bring up from the deep?"}],"gift":"A pearl from the deep","giftText":"Your deepest wisdom shines."}],"obstacles":[{"title":"A Closed Door","icon":"🚪","text":"The door in front of you is locked. Life sometimes says: not this way – not yet.","key":"What door in your life feels closed right now – and what might be waiting behind another one?"},{"title":"The Fallen Tree","icon":"🌳","text":"A big tree has fallen across the path. You cannot simply walk on.","key":"What unexpected obstacle taught you something important?"},{"title":"Thick Fog","icon":"🌫","text":"Fog rises. You can hardly see your next step.","key":"When everything feels unclear – what helps you find your way?"},{"title":"The Wall of Fear","icon":"🧱","text":"A high wall stands before you. It is made of old fears.","key":"Which fear would you like to let go of?"},{"title":"The Heavy Backpack","icon":"🎒","text":"Your backpack has become so heavy that you cannot go on.","key":"What are you carrying that is not yours to carry?"},{"title":"A Misunderstanding","icon":"💬","text":"Words got tangled. Someone understood you differently than you meant.","key":"What would help to clear a misunderstanding in your life?"},{"title":"The Rushing River","icon":"🌊","text":"A wild river blocks the path. No bridge in sight.","key":"Where in your life do you need patience until the waters calm down?"},{"title":"Stormy Weather","icon":"⛈","text":"A storm breaks out. Thunder, wind, rain.","key":"How do you take care of yourself in stormy times?"},{"title":"The Old Habit","icon":"🔁","text":"You catch yourself walking in an old circle again.","key":"Which old pattern is ready to be changed?"},{"title":"Self-Doubt","icon":"🪞","text":"A voice inside says: You can't do this.","key":"What would you say to a friend who doubts themselves?"},{"title":"The Locked Gate","icon":"🔒","text":"A gate with a heavy lock. Someone once said: every lock has a key.","key":"What is the key you already carry within you?"},{"title":"Tired Feet","icon":"🥾","text":"Your feet are tired. Every step feels hard.","key":"What do you need right now to feel strong again?"}],"chambers":[{"kind":"rest","title":"The Candle Room","text":"Behind a hidden door: soft cushions, warm candlelight, a sleeping cat. Time slows down.","q":"What does your body need right now?"},{"kind":"rest","title":"The Moss Grotto","text":"A cool, green grotto. Water drips softly. You lie down on soft moss.","q":"When did you last truly rest?"},{"kind":"rest","title":"The Starlight Room","text":"A dome full of stars. You lie on your back and simply breathe.","q":"What would you love to let go of tonight?"},{"kind":"rest","title":"The Tea Room","text":"A little room with a teapot steaming. Someone left a cup just for you.","q":"Who or what nourishes you?"},{"kind":"learn","title":"The Library of the Soul","text":"Endless shelves. One book glows – it is the book of your life.","q":"Which chapter of your life taught you the most?"},{"kind":"learn","title":"The Mirror Hall","text":"A hall of mirrors – each shows you at another age.","q":"What would you tell your younger self?"},{"kind":"learn","title":"The Map Room","text":"An old map of your journey lies on a table. You see where you have been.","q":"Which turning point changed your path?"},{"kind":"learn","title":"The Whispering Room","text":"Voices of wise ancestors whisper softly.","q":"Which wisdom from your family do you carry?"},{"kind":"light","title":"The Chamber of Light","text":"Golden light flows from the walls into your heart.","q":"Where does your light want to shine?"},{"kind":"light","title":"The Crystal Heart","text":"In the middle of the room floats a crystal in the shape of a heart.","q":"What is the most loving thing about you?"},{"kind":"light","title":"The Chamber of Gratitude","text":"Every wall is covered with small golden thank-you notes – all addressed to you.","q":"Whom do you want to thank today?"}],"funny":[{"icon":"🐱","title":"Two Tiny Kittens","text":"Behind a bush you find two baby kittens – one is chasing its own tail and falls over.","prompt":"Everyone: make your best kitten sound!","effect":"allPearl"},{"icon":"📞","title":"Speak of the Devil","text":"You think of a friend – and in that very second your phone rings. It's her!","prompt":"Who would you love to call right now?","effect":"bring"},{"icon":"⏰","title":"Right Place, Right Time","text":"You arrive at the bakery exactly when the warm croissants come out of the oven.","prompt":"When were you in the right place at the right time?","effect":"walk2"},{"icon":"🧦","title":"The Missing Sock","text":"After three years you finally find your favourite sock – inside the duvet cover.","prompt":"What 'lost' thing turned up when you least expected it?","effect":"coin"},{"icon":"🦆","title":"The Duck Parade","text":"A mother duck with seven ducklings stops the traffic. Everyone smiles and waits.","prompt":"Waddle like a duck around your chair!","effect":"allForward"},{"icon":"☔","title":"Umbrella Luck","text":"It starts pouring the moment you step inside. Not one drop on you!","prompt":"Tell a moment when luck was really on your side.","effect":"fly3"},{"icon":"🎂","title":"Same Birthday","text":"You meet a stranger at a party – you share the same birthday and the same favourite cake.","prompt":"What tiny coincidence connected you with someone?","effect":"cardinal"},{"icon":"🐶","title":"The Happy Dog","text":"A dog runs up, wags its whole body and drops a stick at your feet – it chose you!","prompt":"Everyone: wag like a happy dog!","effect":"allPearl"},{"icon":"🎵","title":"The Song in Your Head","text":"You hum a song – and two seconds later it plays on the radio.","prompt":"Hum a song and let the others guess it!","effect":"music"},{"icon":"🍀","title":"Four-Leaf Clover","text":"You sit down on the grass and your hand lands right on a four-leaf clover.","prompt":"What are you lucky about today?","effect":"lucky"},{"icon":"😂","title":"The Giggle Attack","text":"Something tiny makes you laugh – and you cannot stop. Everyone starts laughing with you.","prompt":"Try to say 'Golden Path' three times very fast!","effect":"energy"},{"icon":"🧁","title":"The Last Cupcake","text":"Everyone reaches for the last cupcake – so you share it in four tiny pieces.","prompt":"What's the best thing you ever shared?","effect":"giftStep"},{"icon":"🚌","title":"The Bus Waits","text":"You run, you wave – and the bus driver smiles and waits for you.","prompt":"Who waited for you when you needed it?","effect":"walk2"},{"icon":"🌈","title":"Double Rainbow","text":"Not one – two rainbows appear. You can't stop saying 'wow'.","prompt":"Everyone: say 'wow' in your most amazed voice!","effect":"toGate"},{"icon":"📬","title":"The Perfect Letter","text":"A card from an old friend arrives on exactly the day you needed it.","prompt":"Whom could you surprise with a little message?","effect":"key"},{"icon":"🦋","title":"Butterfly Landing","text":"A butterfly lands on your nose and refuses to leave.","prompt":"Make a butterfly with your hands and let it fly to someone!","effect":"bring"},{"icon":"🍝","title":"Kitchen Chaos","text":"You try a new recipe – the kitchen looks like a battlefield, but it tastes amazing!","prompt":"What's your funniest cooking story?","effect":"coin"},{"icon":"🐦","title":"The Bird Concert","text":"Outside your window, birds start a loud morning concert – just for you.","prompt":"Everyone: whistle like a bird!","effect":"allPearl"},{"icon":"🔑","title":"The Keys Were There","text":"You search the whole house for your keys – they were in your hand.","prompt":"When did you last laugh at yourself?","effect":"rest"},{"icon":"✨","title":"The Wink of the Universe","text":"You ask for a sign – and the next car's number plate reads 'YES'.","prompt":"What sign made you smile lately?","effect":"fly3"},{"icon":"💌","title":"A Beautiful Letter","text":"In your mailbox: a handwritten letter full of kind words – no bills, just love.","prompt":"Whom would you love to write a little letter to?","effect":"key"},{"icon":"📧","title":"The Loving E-Mail","text":"Between all the work mails, one says: 'Just wanted to tell you – you're wonderful.'","prompt":"Send someone at this table a loving sentence – out loud!","effect":"cardinal"},{"icon":"☕","title":"A Cup of Tea","text":"A colleague puts a cup of steaming tea on your desk – just because.","prompt":"What little gesture warms your heart?","effect":"energy"},{"icon":"🍫","title":"Hot Chocolate Surprise","text":"On a cold day, someone hands you a hot chocolate with whipped cream on top.","prompt":"Who deserves a hot chocolate from you?","effect":"giftStep"},{"icon":"📒","title":"The Funny Notepad","text":"You get a colourful notepad with a funny little drawing on every page. You smile every time you use it.","prompt":"What little thing makes you smile every day?","effect":"coin"},{"icon":"🌻","title":"Flowers at the Door","text":"You open the door – a little bunch of sunflowers is waiting there for you.","prompt":"What brightens your day like sunflowers?","effect":"walk2"},{"icon":"🎁","title":"The Unexpected Gift","text":"A small parcel arrives. Inside: exactly the thing you secretly wished for.","prompt":"What tiny wish would you love to come true?","effect":"lucky"},{"icon":"📮","title":"The Postcard","text":"A colourful postcard from far away: 'Thinking of you!'","prompt":"Where would you send a postcard from?","effect":"bring"},{"icon":"🍪","title":"Cookies from the Neighbour","text":"Your neighbour rings the bell with a plate of warm cookies.","prompt":"How could you surprise a neighbour?","effect":"allPearl"},{"icon":"🎈","title":"A Balloon for You","text":"A child gives you a balloon in the park – just like that.","prompt":"When did a child make your day?","effect":"fly3"}],"canvas":[{"title":"The Blank Canvas","text":"Your life is not a finished story. It is a white canvas – and you hold the brush.","prompt":"What do you want to paint on your canvas today?"},{"title":"Today Is a New Beginning","text":"Every morning the canvas is fresh again. Yesterday does not decide today.","prompt":"What would you love to begin anew today?"},{"title":"You Hold the Brush","text":"No one else can paint your picture. Every choice is a brushstroke.","prompt":"Which brushstroke will you add this week?"},{"title":"Not Yet Written","text":"The next page of your story is still empty. You are the author.","prompt":"What should the next chapter be called?"},{"title":"A Conscious Choice","text":"Between what happens and how you respond lies a space – and in it, your freedom.","prompt":"Which conscious choice will you make today?"},{"title":"Paint Over the Old","text":"A colour you don't like any more? You can paint over it. Change is always possible.","prompt":"What old colour in your life are you ready to paint over?"},{"title":"Colour Someone's Day","text":"Your colours spill over – a smile, a word, a little gift brightens another canvas too.","prompt":"Whose day can you colour today?"},{"title":"Masterpiece in Progress","text":"You don't have to be finished. You are a beautiful work in progress.","prompt":"What are you proud of in your picture so far?"},{"title":"Sunrise Reset","text":"The sun rises and paints the sky new – every single day, without exception.","prompt":"What can you let go of tonight, so tomorrow is fresh?"},{"title":"Many Colours, One Picture","text":"Joy, sadness, courage, doubt – every colour belongs to the picture of your life.","prompt":"Which 'difficult' colour made your picture richer?"},{"title":"Draw Your Own Path","text":"There is no wrong way to paint. Your path is your own unique line.","prompt":"Where do you want to draw your line next?"},{"title":"Together on the Canvas","text":"Some pictures we paint together. Every companion adds their colour.","prompt":"Which colours has someone at this table brought into your life?"}],"herenow":[{"title":"This Step","text":"Before you move, feel this one step. Not the next, not the last – this one.","prompt":"Feel your feet. Where are you right now?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Five Things","text":"Look around and name five things you can see – slowly, one by one.","prompt":"What did you notice that you hadn't seen before?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"One Breath","text":"Breathe in as if for the very first time. Breathe out as if letting go of everything.","prompt":"How does this breath feel?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"The Observer","text":"Watch your thoughts like clouds passing a wide blue sky. You are the sky.","prompt":"Which thought would you like to let pass by?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Listen","text":"Close your eyes and listen for ten seconds. Count the sounds.","prompt":"Which sound was the quietest?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Slow Motion","text":"Make your next movement in slow motion – lift the dice as if it were a feather.","prompt":"What changes when you slow down?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"The Present Is a Gift","text":"That is why it is called the present. Unwrap this moment.","prompt":"What gift is in this very moment?","effect":"key"},{"title":"Taste the Moment","text":"If this moment had a taste – what would it be?","prompt":"Describe it to the others!","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Body Scan","text":"From your head down to your toes – where do you feel warmth, where tension?","prompt":"What does your body want to tell you?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Here, Now, Together","text":"Look into the eyes of everyone at the table for one moment.","prompt":"What did you see in their eyes?","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Mindful Walking","text":"Every step on the Golden Path is a step in your life. Walk it consciously.","prompt":"Which step in your life do you want to walk more consciously?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Nothing to Do","text":"For ten seconds there is nothing to do and nowhere to go. Just be.","prompt":"How was it to simply be?","effect":"rest"}],"possibilities":[{"title":"The Empty Page","fear":"“I don't know what to write – it might be wrong.”","open":"“An empty page – anything is possible!”","prompt":"What would you do if you knew you could not fail?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"A New Job","fear":"“What if I'm not good enough?”","open":"“What could I learn and who could I meet?”","prompt":"Which chance is waiting for you right now?","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"Moving to a New Place","fear":"“I'll be all alone there.”","open":"“New friends, new streets, new adventures.”","prompt":"Where would you love to explore?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"A Stranger Smiles","fear":"“What does that person want from me?”","open":"“How nice – someone is friendly to me.”","prompt":"When did a stranger become a friend?","effect":"bring"},{"title":"A Change of Plans","fear":"“Everything is ruined!”","open":"“Maybe something even better is coming.”","prompt":"When did a change of plans become a gift?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"Speaking in Front of Others","fear":"“Everyone will judge me.”","open":"“I have something valuable to share.”","prompt":"What message do you want to share with the world?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Trying Something New","fear":"“I'll look silly.”","open":"“I'll discover something about myself.”","prompt":"What new thing would you love to try?","effect":"double"},{"title":"An Ending","fear":"“Now it's all over.”","open":"“Every ending is a door to a new beginning.”","prompt":"Which ending opened a new door for you?","effect":"key"},{"title":"Not Knowing","fear":"“I need to know exactly what will happen.”","open":"“I can trust and see what unfolds.”","prompt":"Where can you trust a little more?","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Asking for Help","fear":"“I'm a burden.”","open":"“Help connects us.”","prompt":"Whom could you ask for help – and when?","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"The Big Dream","fear":"“That's too big for me.”","open":"“Every big dream starts with one small step.”","prompt":"What is the first small step toward your dream?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"A Closed Door","fear":"“There is no way forward.”","open":"“There are a thousand other doors.”","prompt":"Which other door could you knock on?","effect":"toGate"}],"breath":[{"title":"Ruach","text":"In the Hebrew Bible the word Ruach appears almost 400 times. It means wind, breath and spirit – and also energy and life force. The same word for your breath and for the Spirit.","prompt":"Breathe in slowly. Feel the life force that breathes you.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"The North Wind","text":"Air, wind, the North: the direction of higher consciousness, of clarity and stillness. Let the wind clear your mind.","prompt":"What would you like the wind to carry away today?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"Respiration – Inspiration","text":"Breathing in is the root of the word inspiration. Every conscious breath can bring a new idea.","prompt":"Breathe in three times. Which idea arrives?","effect":"insight"},{"title":"Listen to the Whispers","text":"The wind does not shout. It whispers. Your inner voice speaks the same way – quietly.","prompt":"Close your eyes for a moment. What does the whisper say?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"No Action","text":"Sometimes the wisest step is no step at all. Stillness is not standing still – it is listening.","prompt":"Can you allow yourself one minute of doing nothing?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Watch for Signs","text":"The wind moves the leaves, the clouds, a feather. Signs are everywhere when we observe.","prompt":"Look around you right now. What sign do you notice?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Answers from Within","text":"Some answers cannot be found by thinking. They come with the wind, from deep within, when you are quiet.","prompt":"Which question do you give to the wind today?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"Clearing","text":"After the wind, the sky is clear. Breath clears the body; stillness clears the mind.","prompt":"Breathe out everything heavy. What feels lighter now?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Relaxation","text":"With every breath out, let your shoulders sink a little more. Nothing to hold, nothing to prove.","prompt":"Where in your body do you feel the breath right now?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Quietness","text":"In the quiet, you hear what was always there: birds, your heartbeat, the life around you.","prompt":"Everyone listens for ten seconds. What did you hear?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"The Breath Connects Us","text":"We all breathe the same air. The breath you let go is breathed by someone else. Everything is connected.","prompt":"Breathe together with everyone at the table – three times.","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Spirit Breathes","text":"The wind blows where it wishes. You cannot see it, but you see what it moves. So it is with the Spirit in your life.","prompt":"Where have you felt an invisible force move you?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Be in Your Heart","text":"It begins and ends with breath. Breathe – and be in your heart.","prompt":"Hand on your heart: breathe three times.","effect":"energy"}],"chalice":[{"title":"The Pond","text":"Think about a pond fed by a living spring. Fresh water flows in, clear water flows out. That is why it stays clean.","prompt":"What fresh insight would you like to flow into your life?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Let It Flow","text":"Water that stands still becomes stale. Wisdom stays fresh when it keeps flowing – in and out.","prompt":"What wisdom would you like to pass on today?","effect":"giftStep"},{"title":"Cleanse","text":"Let the water of the source cleanse you of old worries, old opinions, old pain.","prompt":"What would you like to wash away?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"Old Teachings","text":"Do not hold on to old education and old information just because it is old. Keep what is true – let the rest go.","prompt":"Which old belief is ready to be released?","effect":"insight"},{"title":"Open Hands","text":"A closed fist can hold nothing new. Open your hands, and your chalice can be filled.","prompt":"What are you ready to receive?","effect":"coin"},{"title":"Receiving and Giving","text":"Keep the balance: receive with gratitude, give with joy. A chalice that only receives overflows; one that only gives runs dry.","prompt":"Where do you need more balance – in receiving or in giving?","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Connect to the Source","text":"Every river remembers its spring. Renew your wisdom again and again by connecting to the Source.","prompt":"What connects you to the Source – prayer, nature, music, silence?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Free and Open","text":"Make yourself free and open to receive. New teachings come to the open heart.","prompt":"What new teaching has come to you lately?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Still Water","text":"Only still water reflects the sky. When you are calm, you can see clearly.","prompt":"Breathe until your inner water is calm. What do you see?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Share the Water","text":"Water given to a thirsty traveller is never lost. It comes back as a river.","prompt":"Offer a kind word to someone at the table.","effect":"bring"},{"title":"Renew","text":"Wisdom is not a possession; it is a spring. Renew it every day.","prompt":"What did you learn this week?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"The Overflowing Cup","text":"When your chalice is full, let it overflow to others. Your abundance blesses everyone.","prompt":"What do you have in abundance that you can share?","effect":"pullUp"},{"title":"Be a Well","text":"You are allowed to be like a well – a living source. Let it flow, and be surprised by what happens.","prompt":"What would like to flow through you?","effect":"pullUp"},{"title":"The Golden Chalice of Your Heart","text":"Your golden heart is your golden chalice. Open it, and golden rays of light flow in – and shine out to everyone around you. Paths are different; the golden heart wisdom is the same in everyone.","prompt":"Hand on your heart: plug in to the light – and let it shine out.","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"A Full Cup","text":"If your chalice is filled to the top, can you take in more? No – first you free it, drop by drop.","prompt":"What is one drop you are ready to pour out?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"Letting Go","text":"Give away what no longer serves you – things, burdens, old habits. Then plan good habits and new rhythms.","prompt":"Which old habit do you swap for a new rhythm?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"What Is Inside You?","text":"Wood, glass or gold – the vessel doesn’t matter. What matters is the content.","prompt":"What gift flows from your heart to others?","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Droplets of God","text":"In the sacred space you have freed, kindness, warmth, wisdom and love can settle – droplets of God.","prompt":"Which quality would you love to receive today?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Refill Yourself","text":"Serving others is beautiful – and self-care matters too. Treat your chalice with respect and kindness, and refill it.","prompt":"How will you refill your chalice this week?","effect":"energy"}],"guides":[{"kind":"Human","title":"A Friend Who Calls","text":"Just when you need it, a friend calls. Humans on your path are sent to give you strength.","prompt":"Which person has given you strength recently?","effect":"cardinal"},{"kind":"Human","title":"The Teacher on the Way","text":"A stranger says one sentence that changes everything. Teachers appear when we are ready.","prompt":"Which sentence from someone has stayed with you?","effect":"insight"},{"kind":"Human","title":"Family","text":"Those who love you walk beside you – near or far, here or beyond.","prompt":"Who in your family would you like to thank?","effect":"allPearl"},{"kind":"Angel","title":"Your Guardian Angel","text":"You are welcomed and loved, guided and safe. Your angel walks every step with you.","prompt":"Ask your angel for one thing you need today.","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Angel","title":"Angel of Courage","text":"An angel touches your shoulder: “You can do this. You are not alone.”","prompt":"Where do you need courage right now?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Angel","title":"Angel of Peace","text":"Peace settles around you like a soft blanket. Everything is unfolding as it should.","prompt":"Breathe in peace. Breathe out worry.","effect":"rest"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"The Eagle","text":"The eagle lifts you high above. From there you see your whole path – and how all is connected.","prompt":"What do you see when you look at your life from above?","effect":"toGate"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"The Deer","text":"The deer walks gently and listens with its whole body. It teaches you to move with awareness.","prompt":"Walk your next step slowly and consciously.","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"The Turtle","text":"The turtle is not in a hurry, yet it always arrives. It carries its home with it.","prompt":"Where can you slow down and still arrive?","effect":"rest"},{"kind":"Dragonfly","title":"Dragonfly","text":"Drag on, traveler. Spread your wings and fly.","prompt":"Where are you ready to fly?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Dragonfly","title":"Hover","text":"Stop. Hover. Enjoy this moment.","prompt":"What do you notice right now?","effect":"rest"},{"kind":"Dragonfly","title":"Messenger","text":"A messenger from your guides: reveal your true Self and live life fully.","prompt":"What is ready to change in you?","effect":"lift5"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"The Blue Tit","text":"Playful and full of ideas, the blue tit invites you to fly up and look again. From above, your challenges become small pieces on your game board – and you decide how to play.","prompt":"Which idea will you start today – not tomorrow?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"A Guide with Humour","text":"Your guides are wise and honourable – and they have a wonderful sense of humour!","prompt":"Tell everyone something funny that happened on your path.","effect":"allPearl"},{"kind":"Dragonfly","title":"The Golden Web","text":"The dragonfly, creature of wind and water, shows you: you are part of a golden web – connected to your land and to the whole world.","prompt":"Whom do you feel connected to, near or far?","effect":"pullUp"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"A Gentle Push","text":"Your guide gives you warmth and embracing love – and a gentle push when something in you wants to come out into the world.","prompt":"What wants to come out of you into the world?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Spirit Animal","title":"Be What You Are Meant to BE","text":"Your guide helps you awaken, free your Self and live your soul purpose – to do and to BE exactly what you are meant to be.","prompt":"What is your soul longing to be?","effect":"lift5"},{"kind":"Angel","title":"You Sense Them","text":"You don’t have to see your guides – mostly you sense them. They calm you, protect you and support you. Dare to call them in.","prompt":"Close your eyes and call in your guides. What do you sense?","effect":"rest"},{"kind":"Angel","title":"The Golden Angel","text":"With the golden angel at your side you can master everything. Trust – you are protected and guided.","prompt":"What would you dare if you knew you were completely safe?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"Loved Ones","title":"Love Beyond the Veil","text":"Connection does not end with physical absence. Love is a living bridge between worlds. Your loved ones walk beside you.","prompt":"How can you notice the love and subtle signs around you each day?","effect":"rest"}],"whispers":["Slow down. The next step is enough.","Breathe. The answer will come.","You are not alone – look who walks beside you.","Trust the path. It knows the way.","Listen to your heart, not your fear.","Ask for help – it is a gift to the one who helps.","Watch for a sign in the next minute.","Be kind to yourself today.","Let go of what you cannot change.","Look at it from high above: what really matters?","Share what you have learned.","Rest is part of the journey.","The door you need is already opening.","Choose love over fear.","Say thank you – out loud.","You may stop, go back, or begin again. All are allowed.","Look into the eyes of the person next to you and smile.","Your light is needed exactly where you are.","There is a plan – and you hold the brush.","Everything is changing. Nothing is pre-ordained.","Put your hand on your heart. It knows the way.","Nothing in your life is lost. Every moment is meant to be.","The vessel is not important – it is what you let flow out of it.","Love is in each step you take.","Your life is a gift. You may choose – choose wisely.","Spread your wings and free your Self.","Focus on hope – in every single moment.","A positive attitude is your choice.","Options open up in front of you. Choose with your heart.","Even baby steps are steps. Move!","Go with the flow – no resistance. One step at a time.","Walk with your loved ones – here and beyond the veil.","Eyes, ears, heart and soul wide open.","Feel the small spark of joy for your next step.","The Source is your home base – your charger.","Be a messenger of calmness.","In the deepest darkness of the night you see a small light – your soul light.","Sometimes the goal seems near and the path is longer than expected. Keep moving.","Light is life, life is love.","Heaven is just one step aside.","Your life unfolds right in front of you – lit step by step.","You are the hero of your story. Write it with your golden feather.","One thought creates life. Your written word is the light code of your soul.","Walk brightly and lightheartedly – your golden heartlight shows the way.","Let light and love be the focus of your thoughts, words and deeds.","There is no right or wrong – only lessons.","Think and speak the truth, pure from the heart.","Within trust lies the truth. Within honesty lies the next impulse.","No need to worry or hurry – each step will unfold and light up.","Teachers come when you are ready to listen. Students walk with you when you are ready to share.","Your future is brighter and more blessed than you can imagine.","Ask your guides: What have you got for me today?","Uplift yourself – and without a word you uplift everyone around you.","Help from a place of love – not from fear or obligation.","To believe is halfway. To trust is the next step. To know is the outcome.","Life is a chapter in your Golden Book – fill your pages wisely, curiously, lovingly.","Jump – an invisible net unfolds to catch you.","Two ears form a heart. Listen with the ears of your heart.","It’s simple: breathe. Be still. Be.","A drop of water is the whole ocean.","Every choice is a chance.","Fear? Accept it, observe it – no judgement.","Focus on the feather – the light, easy-going way.","Be a golden heart magnet.","Put your thoughts aside – and feel.","You are a miracle.","Decisions are healing.","Move on, drag on – feel good, feel God, feel free.","Your heart is your treasure, your hidden gem.","Lessons are not punishment. They are initiations.","You are not meant to be empty – you are meant to be clear.","When you are tired, rest. When you are uncertain, listen.","I walk the Golden Path – and the Golden Path walks me home.","I move with life, and life moves with me.","I walk in trust, guided by love seen and unseen.","Like a tuning fork, you resonate with what you choose. What you radiate, you receive.","The challenge is not the obstacle. The resistance is. Flow begins when you listen."],"teacher":[{"title":"Become the Teacher","text":"You have learned something on this path. Now it is your turn to teach.","prompt":"Share one lesson from your life with everyone."},{"title":"Question the Teacher","text":"Good students listen. Wise students also ask questions – and so they become teachers themselves.","prompt":"What is a question you have never dared to ask?"},{"title":"Your Aha-Moment","text":"An aha-moment is a pearl of wisdom. Give it to the circle.","prompt":"Tell the group about a recent aha-moment."},{"title":"Learning from a Child","text":"Sometimes the youngest are the wisest teachers.","prompt":"What has a child taught you?"},{"title":"A Lesson from a Mistake","text":"Every stumble on the path taught you something.","prompt":"Share a mistake that became a gift."},{"title":"Pass It On","text":"Wisdom grows when it is shared. Your experience may be exactly what someone needs.","prompt":"What advice would you give to your younger self?"},{"title":"The Student Within","text":"Even teachers keep learning. Stay curious.","prompt":"What would you love to learn next?"},{"title":"Many Teachers","text":"Nature, animals, strangers, difficulties – all can be teachers.","prompt":"Who or what was an unexpected teacher in your life?"}],"again":[{"title":"Walk It Again","text":"Sometimes you walk the same path again and again until you understand the lesson. That is not failure – it is learning.","prompt":"Which lesson keeps coming back to you?"},{"title":"You May Stop","text":"You decide on your own: to stop, to go back, to start again. Every choice is allowed.","prompt":"Where in your life would you like to pause?"},{"title":"A New Beginning","text":"Every day is more or less a new beginning. You can always start again.","prompt":"What would you like to begin fresh?"},{"title":"Stumbling Is Walking","text":"At first we may walk anxious, stumbling, unsure. Step by step we become courageous, calm and full of trust.","prompt":"Where have you become more courageous?"},{"title":"Not Running Fast","text":"The goal is not to run fast to the centre. Let your aha-moments settle within you.","prompt":"What needs a little more time to settle in you?"},{"title":"Look Back with Love","text":"Turn around for a moment and look at the path you have already walked.","prompt":"What are you proud of on your path so far?"},{"title":"The Same Place, New Eyes","text":"Coming back to the same place, you are not the same person. You see it differently now.","prompt":"What do you see differently today than a year ago?"},{"title":"Settle Down","text":"Like water that clears when it stops moving, let everything settle down.","prompt":"Breathe and let everything settle for a moment."}],"signs2":[{"kind":"good","title":"A Rainbow","text":"A sign that points you toward good things. Follow it – something beautiful is waiting.","prompt":"What good thing are you moving toward?","effect":"walk2"},{"kind":"good","title":"An Open Door","text":"A door opens by itself. This sign points to where good things happen.","prompt":"Which door has opened for you recently?","effect":"fly3"},{"kind":"good","title":"A White Feather","text":"A feather at your feet: you are guided and safe. Good things are on their way.","prompt":"What makes you feel safe?","effect":"coin"},{"kind":"good","title":"The Same Number Again","text":"You see the same number everywhere. The universe says: you are on the right track.","prompt":"Which number keeps appearing in your life?","effect":"lucky"},{"kind":"good","title":"A Song on the Radio","text":"Just the right song plays at just the right moment. Follow the music.","prompt":"Which song carries a message for you?","effect":"music"},{"kind":"lesson","title":"A Closed Road","text":"A sign that points you toward a lesson. The road is closed – there is something to learn here first.","prompt":"What might this obstacle want to teach you?","effect":"detour"},{"kind":"lesson","title":"The Same Situation Again","text":"It happens again. Life repeats a lesson until we understand it.","prompt":"Which situation repeats in your life – and what is it teaching you?","effect":"detourLight"},{"kind":"lesson","title":"A Missed Bus","text":"You missed it – and in the waiting, something new can happen. Lessons hide in delays.","prompt":"What did a delay once give you?","effect":"rest"},{"kind":"lesson","title":"A Gentle Stumble","text":"You stumble a little. Look down: what did you overlook?","prompt":"What have you been rushing past?","effect":"insight"},{"kind":"lesson","title":"A Quiet Warning","text":"A feeling in your stomach says: wait. Listening to it is also wisdom.","prompt":"When did your gut feeling protect you?","effect":"rest"}],"intentions":["To focus on love","To trust my path","To be more courageous","To find inner peace","To open my heart","To live with more joy","To let go of fear","To find my purpose","To be present in every step","To heal my heart","To help and inspire others","To be grateful every day","To discover my golden heart"],"above":["Look at your path from high above, as if you were a higher power. See how you began – maybe anxious, stumbling, unsure – and how you are walking now.","From up here you see it: every step is connected. The detours, the loops, the people who walked with you for a while.","See your human being down there on the path – welcomed and loved, guided and safe. You chose each stepping stone to learn."],"gateWisdom":[{"dir":"East","angel":"Angel of the First Fire","deep":"In the East the morning star rises. Every dawn says: everything is made new. Your passion is the first light of your new day."},{"dir":"East","angel":"Angel of New Paths","deep":"The gates of the City of Light are never shut. There is always a way in – sometimes one you have not yet imagined."},{"dir":"East","angel":"Angel of the Breath","deep":"Spirit, breath and wind are one word in an old language. Each breath in is an inspiration from the Source."},{"dir":"South","angel":"Angel of the Golden Rod","deep":"An angel measures the city with a rod of gold. A clear intention is your golden measure: it shows what truly fits your life."},{"dir":"South","angel":"Angel of Healing","deep":"In the City of Light every tear is wiped away and there is no more mourning. Allow yourself to heal – the old order of things passes away."},{"dir":"South","angel":"Angel of the Pure Heart","deep":"Blessed are the pure in heart, for they will see the Divine. A soft, open heart sees light everywhere."},{"dir":"West","angel":"Angel of the Nations","deep":"All peoples walk by the same light and bring their treasures into it. Every person carries a gift the whole circle needs."},{"dir":"West","angel":"Angel of the Golden Street","deep":"The street of the city is pure gold, clear as glass. Let your words be like that: precious, clear and transparent."},{"dir":"West","angel":"Angel of the Quiet Knowing","deep":"The city needs neither sun nor moon – its own light shines from within. So does the knowing in your heart."},{"dir":"North","angel":"Angel of the Holy City","deep":"Imagine a city of light descending, shining like a precious jewel, clear as crystal. Whatever you can imagine with love can come down into your life."},{"dir":"North","angel":"Angel of the Single Pearl","deep":"Each of the twelve gates is made of one single pearl. A pearl grows from a grain of sand that hurt – your pain can become your gate."},{"dir":"North","angel":"Angel of No Night","deep":"In the North dwell stillness and higher consciousness. In the City of Light there is no night – in deep silence you are always in the light."}],"morningStar":"The Morning Star rises within you. To the pure in heart, the greatest reward is not a prize but the Light itself – a new day, a new beginning, everything made new.","magic":[{"title":"Magic from Within","text":"Magic comes from deep within. The vessel is not what matters – it is what you let flow out of it."},{"title":"The Tightrope Walker","text":"Like a tightrope walker, stay aware and keep your balance. Harmony comes from the balance in between."},{"title":"A Never-Ending Circle","text":"Life is a never-ending circle with no beginning and no end: growing and dissolving, learning and experiencing. That is evolution."},{"title":"Here You Are","text":"You look for the mysteries of your earthly life – and here you are: now, today. Let go of fear and focus on flow and trust."},{"title":"An Actor in the Big Game","text":"You received a human body to be an actor in the big game of life. Each of you is unique and chooses your own moments to grow."},{"title":"Nothing Is Lost","text":"There is no point in your life that is lost. Every step, every moment is meant to be. No delay, no worry – just trust and knowing."},{"title":"An Honoured Decision","text":"To experience life is one of the most honoured decisions a soul makes. As a piece of the Source of oneness, you may light up your own path."},{"title":"Teachers All Around","text":"Teachers and guides are around you all the time, always pointing you to the best direction."},{"title":"The Alchemist","text":"You are an alchemist, transforming each moment with pure awareness. You become what you already are: a being of light, a teacher, a guide."},{"title":"Hand on Your Heart","text":"Put your hand on your chest. Your heart is the centre, the home, the goal: loving, open, observing, forgiving, healing, whole."},{"title":"To Be in Your Heart","text":"To be in your heart means to act out of love – for your higher Self and for all of humankind."},{"title":"You Are the Chalice","text":"All creation comes from the Source. The Source gives you the gift – you are the messenger, you are the chalice."},{"title":"The Inner Ear","text":"Deep within you are reached: through your inner ear, your heart. There you find respect and honour, freedom and joy."},{"title":"Love in Every Step","text":"Love is always in each step you take."}],"love":[{"title":"Love Yourself First","text":"First love yourself, inside. Then you can love outside yourself. Love is a mirror.","prompt":"Say one kind sentence to yourself – out loud.","effect":"coin"},{"title":"The Answer Is You","text":"Some say: “He or she makes me unhappy.” Yet the answer to this hunger is you. Make yourself happy first.","prompt":"What makes you truly happy – just you, just now?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Forgive","text":"When we hurt someone, we hurt ourselves – because we are one. Forgiveness heals both sides.","prompt":"Is there someone you are ready to forgive, even a little?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"The Quilt","text":"We are all woven into one great quilt. One thread of anger can damage it; one thread of love can mend it.","prompt":"Which thread would you like to mend?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Fingers of One Hand","text":"We are all different fingers – on one hand.","prompt":"Hold hands with the people next to you for a moment.","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Your Sacred Part","text":"Every single one of us plays a sacred part – even those who think they make no difference. You don't need to build towers and bridges. Being loving changes the world.","prompt":"Where did your kindness make a difference recently?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Words Are Powerful","text":"Every thought is already an expression of your Self. Words are powerful – choose them with love.","prompt":"Which word would you like to give to the circle?","effect":"cardinal"},{"title":"Choose a Yes","text":"Every day we choose: the air we breathe, what we take in with our eyes, ears and mouth. Some choices lift us up, some pull us down. Choose a clear yes.","prompt":"What is one clear yes for your life today?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Ask, and an Opening Forms","text":"No door? It doesn't matter. Ask – and an opening will form.","prompt":"What would you like to ask for?","effect":"toGate"},{"title":"Plug In to Love","text":"Touch a tree, a flower, an animal, a friend – and feel the waves of love and energy flowing to you.","prompt":"What fills you with love when you touch it?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Be You","text":"Be authentic. Be you. That is enough – and that is beautiful.","prompt":"What is something truly you that you'd like to show more?","effect":"coin"},{"title":"Above All, Put On Love","text":"Over all these virtues, put on love. Whoever stays in love, stays in the Divine.","prompt":"How can you put on love like a coat today?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Reconciliation","text":"Set aside the struggle. Find peace and get along with each other – it may take a little while, and that is fine.","prompt":"With whom would you love to make peace?","effect":"allPearl"}],"calmFirst":{"title":"Calm First","text":"When a trial comes, first become calm – and smile. Ask: what is this here to teach me? Trials grow perseverance, and perseverance makes you whole. Little by little the light comes."},"emotions":[{"feel":"Anger","gift":"Courage and clear boundaries","text":"Anger shows you what matters to you. Breathe – and turn its fire into courage and a clear, kind “no”."},{"feel":"Fear","gift":"Care and awareness","text":"Fear wants to protect you. Thank it – then take one small, brave step with open eyes."},{"feel":"Sadness","gift":"Compassion and depth","text":"Sadness shows how deeply you can love. Let the tears flow; they soften the heart for compassion."},{"feel":"Envy","gift":"Knowing your own wish","text":"Envy points to your own longing. What you admire in others is a seed in you."},{"feel":"Overwhelm","gift":"Focus on one step","text":"Too much at once? Put your hand on your heart. Only this one next step matters."},{"feel":"Disappointment","gift":"Letting go of expectations","text":"Sometimes we don’t get what we ask for. Release the expectation – and see what else is offered."},{"feel":"Guilt","gift":"Learning and forgiving","text":"Guilt asks you to learn, not to suffer. Make it right where you can, then forgive yourself."},{"feel":"Restlessness","gift":"Presence","text":"Restless? Feel your feet on the ground. Breathe three times. Here you are – now."}],"walk":[{"title":"Stay Curious","text":"Stay curious – like a child.","prompt":"What would you love to discover?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Be Courageous","text":"Don’t hesitate – be courageous.","prompt":"Which step have you been postponing?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Breathe and Step","text":"Take a deep breath – and step forward.","prompt":"Breathe in… and take your step.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Open Heart","text":"Stay open-hearted. Your heart is your inner ear.","prompt":"What does your heart hear right now?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Scan Your Field","text":"Be aware. Observe. Scan the field around you.","prompt":"What do you notice that you overlooked before?","effect":"insight"},{"title":"You Can Choose","text":"In every moment you can choose: step forward, or pause, breathe and follow your heart.","prompt":"What do you choose right now?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"No Expectations","text":"Free yourself from expectations. Be authentic – feel what is best for you.","prompt":"Which expectation can you let go of?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"No Matter What","text":"Be grateful for what comes to you – no matter what.","prompt":"Name one thing you are grateful for today.","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"You Matter","text":"You matter. Focus on what matters most.","prompt":"What matters most to you?","effect":"coin"},{"title":"Walk Beside Me","text":"Invite your loved ones to walk beside you.","prompt":"Whom do you invite to walk with you?","effect":"bring"},{"title":"Thoughts – Words – Actions","text":"Thoughts become words, words become actions. Master your golden steps on earth wisely.","prompt":"Which thought would you like to turn into action?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Sun Behind the Clouds","text":"Sometimes the connection feels strong, sometimes weak. Like the sun behind clouds, the light is always there.","prompt":"How do you feel connected today – strong or soft?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Speak It into Reality","text":"Words are powerful. Speak your wish aloud – as if it were already true.","prompt":"Say it now: “I am …”","effect":"coin"},{"title":"Crises Are Chances","text":"Times of crisis and change are chances. Transformation is possible.","prompt":"Which change brought you a gift?","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Waves","text":"Life comes in waves – ups and downs to discover. Go with them, and blessings are always near.","prompt":"What did a low wave teach you?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"How to Live Fearless","text":"How to live fearless and stressless? One conscious step at a time.","prompt":"What helps you feel free of stress?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"How to Find Meaning","text":"How do I find purpose and meaning in my everyday life?","prompt":"Where did you feel meaning this week?","effect":"insight"},{"title":"How to Understand Dreams","text":"How do I understand my dreams and foresights?","prompt":"Share a dream that stayed with you.","effect":"insight"},{"title":"How to Cry or Laugh","text":"How to feel sorrow or joy, how to cry or laugh – all of it belongs to being human.","prompt":"When did you last laugh until you cried?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"How to Be Me","text":"How to be me.","prompt":"Finish the sentence: “I am most myself when …”","effect":"coin"},{"title":"How to Be","text":"How to be.","prompt":"Just be – for ten seconds. Nothing to do.","effect":"rest"},{"title":"What Do You Love?","text":"What do you love doing – so much that you forget the time?","prompt":"Share it with the circle.","effect":"coin"},{"title":"What Does the World Need?","text":"What does the world need – and what is for the best of all?","prompt":"Name one need you see around you.","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Your Purpose","text":"Where what you love meets what the world needs – there is your purpose.","prompt":"What am I here to do? Listen to your heart.","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Be Like Mother Earth","text":"Mother Earth gives you food, energy and shelter, day by day. Honour her – and be like her: serve, nurture, give.","prompt":"Name one thing Mother Earth gave you today – and say thank you.","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Be Like a Child","text":"Play the game like a child – and remember: you are also the player moving the figure, seeing your life from above with your guides and angels.","prompt":"What would the child in you love to do right now?","effect":"lucky"},{"title":"Not the Wrong Path","text":"When things don’t turn out as expected, it doesn’t mean you are on the wrong path. Challenges show you exactly where to step further.","prompt":"Which challenge made you stronger and wiser?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Surf the Waves","text":"Learn to surf the waves – over every obstacle, with ease, strength and comfort within. There is golden grace on your path.","prompt":"Everyone: surf an imaginary wave with your arms!","effect":"fly3"},{"title":"Flow","text":"Flow is not something you force – it is something you allow. Relax your shoulders, soften your jaw, hand on your heart.","prompt":"What is the smallest step that feels light and true? Take it.","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"The Sacred Melody","text":"You are a living note in the symphony of life. Your path unfolds through resonance, not force.","prompt":"Feel your body as an instrument – and hum one note together. What wants to sing through you now?","effect":"allPearl"}],"traffic":[["#3fae5a","Green light","Open your heart – let your guides and loved ones connect with you. Listen. Be grateful."],["#e8c13a","Yellow · The sunny way","Look at the sunny side of this moment."],["#d9453a","Red · Pause","Pause, breathe, take care – listen within."]],"newValues":["Initiation","Dedication","Manifestation","Expansion","Expression","Satisfaction","Reflection","Revelation","Evolution","Observation","Invitation","Appreciation","Liberation","Restoration","Transition","Emanation","Dissolution","Congregation"],"sun":[{"title":"The Sun Gives","text":"The sun gives warmth, love and light – to each and every body, without judgement or distinction.","prompt":"To whom would you like to give warmth without judging?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Bend Your Knees","text":"We may bend our knees before the sun in gratitude for every new day.","prompt":"Bow your head for a moment and say thank you.","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Rays for Everyone","text":"Every ray reaches everyone at the table equally. No one receives less light.","prompt":"Everyone: hold up your hands as if to catch the sunlight.","effect":"allForward"},{"title":"Warmth","text":"Feel the warmth of the sun on your skin. Let it melt what is cold inside.","prompt":"What in you would like to be warmed?","effect":"energy"},{"title":"Shine Like the Sun","text":"Be like the sun: give your light freely, to everyone.","prompt":"Whom will you shine on today?","effect":"pullUp"},{"title":"A Lamp to My Feet","text":"A lamp to my feet, a light to my path. The path is lit step by step – not all at once.","prompt":"What is the one next step that is lit for you?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Behind the Clouds","text":"Even on grey days the sun is shining. The light is always there.","prompt":"What helps you remember the light on grey days?","effect":"rest"}],"colors40":[{"title":"Red","hex":"#d42a3a","text":"Energy and passion. Take one bold step.","prompt":"Stand up and stamp your feet like a hero!"},{"title":"Orange","hex":"#f07a2a","text":"Enthusiasm and creativity.","prompt":"Invent a silly dance move – everyone copies it."},{"title":"Yellow","hex":"#f6cf2a","text":"Optimism and sunshine.","prompt":"Name the bright side of today."},{"title":"Green","hex":"#3fae5a","text":"Growth and renewal.","prompt":"What is growing in your life right now?"},{"title":"Blue","hex":"#2f7fd0","text":"Calm, trust and depth.","prompt":"Three slow breaths – like ocean waves."},{"title":"Purple","hex":"#7d4fb3","text":"Spirit and mystery.","prompt":"Close your eyes: what does your inner world show you?"},{"title":"Pink","hex":"#f08ab8","text":"Love and kindness.","prompt":"Give someone at the table a compliment."},{"title":"Brown","hex":"#8a5a34","text":"Grounding and stability.","prompt":"Feel your feet on the ground. What keeps you steady?"},{"title":"Gray","hex":"#9a9fa6","text":"Balance – the middle way.","prompt":"Where can you meet someone halfway?"},{"title":"Black","hex":"#1b1712","text":"Strength and clear boundaries.","prompt":"Say one clear and kind “no” you need in your life."},{"title":"White","hex":"#f4f1ea","text":"Purity and simplicity.","prompt":"What could you simplify this week?"},{"title":"Magenta","hex":"#c8288a","text":"Universal love and harmony.","prompt":"Hold hands for five seconds – all together."},{"title":"Cyan","hex":"#2ac0d8","text":"Fresh clarity and open words.","prompt":"Say something honest and kind."},{"title":"Turquoise","hex":"#2fb5a5","text":"Healing and creative protection.","prompt":"What soothes your soul?"},{"title":"Indigo","hex":"#3a3a9a","text":"Intuition and inner wisdom.","prompt":"What does your inner voice say right now?"},{"title":"Lavender","hex":"#b8a4e0","text":"Calm and grace.","prompt":"Ten seconds of quiet – just be."},{"title":"Maroon","hex":"#7a1e2e","text":"Steady strength.","prompt":"Which goal do you follow with quiet determination?"},{"title":"Olive","hex":"#8a8a3a","text":"Peace and forgiveness.","prompt":"Is there something small you can forgive today?"},{"title":"Beige","hex":"#e0cfae","text":"Comfort in simple things.","prompt":"Name a simple thing that makes you happy."},{"title":"Coral","hex":"#f07a6a","text":"Friendship and warmth.","prompt":"Who would you love to call this week?"},{"title":"Crimson","hex":"#b0102a","text":"Fire for your dreams.","prompt":"Name one dream – out loud!"},{"title":"Amber","hex":"#f0a020","text":"Small successes.","prompt":"Celebrate one small win from this week – everyone claps!"},{"title":"Emerald","hex":"#1f9a6a","text":"Abundance and growth.","prompt":"Look how far you have come. What are you proud of?"},{"title":"Sapphire","hex":"#1f4aa8","text":"Wisdom and truth.","prompt":"What did life teach you this year?"},{"title":"Ruby","hex":"#c0163a","text":"Courage of the heart.","prompt":"Which heartfelt step are you ready for?"},{"title":"Ivory","hex":"#f8f2e0","text":"Serenity and calm spaces.","prompt":"Where is your peaceful place?"},{"title":"Plum","hex":"#7a3a6a","text":"Depth and transformation.","prompt":"What has changed in you lately?"},{"title":"Fuchsia","hex":"#e02aa0","text":"Bold, playful and creative.","prompt":"Do something unexpected and fun right now!"},{"title":"Periwinkle","hex":"#9aa8f0","text":"Tranquility in a busy day.","prompt":"Where can you find a quiet minute today?"},{"title":"Lime","hex":"#a8d82a","text":"Fresh energy and new ideas.","prompt":"Suggest a brand-new idea – the crazier the better."},{"title":"Peach","hex":"#f8b890","text":"Tenderness and self-care.","prompt":"How will you take care of yourself today?"},{"title":"Mint","hex":"#98e0c0","text":"Fresh perspectives.","prompt":"Look at a problem from a new angle – what do you see?"},{"title":"Copper","hex":"#c0703a","text":"Resilience – you shine through challenges.","prompt":"Which challenge made you stronger?"},{"title":"Bronze","hex":"#a8783a","text":"Roots and heritage.","prompt":"What did your family give you that you treasure?"},{"title":"Champagne","hex":"#f0dcae","text":"Celebration!","prompt":"Raise an invisible glass – toast to someone at the table!"},{"title":"Mauve","hex":"#c09ab0","text":"Gentle healing.","prompt":"What gentle thing does your heart need?"},{"title":"Charcoal","hex":"#3a3a3e","text":"Practical, steady progress.","prompt":"What is one practical next step?"},{"title":"Navy","hex":"#1e2a5a","text":"Calm confidence.","prompt":"Where can you lead with calm and confidence?"},{"title":"Mustard","hex":"#d8a828","text":"Curiosity and play.","prompt":"What would you love to try for the first time?"},{"title":"Auburn","hex":"#a0402a","text":"Authenticity – be truly you.","prompt":"Share one thing that is truly you!"}],"animalsPlus":[{"title":"Dragonfly","text":"Drag on, traveler – spread your wings and fly. Lightness, joy and change.","prompt":"Flutter your hands like wings – what are you ready to change?"},{"title":"Elephant","text":"Wise, patient and never forgets those it loves.","prompt":"Share a memory you treasure."},{"title":"Koi Fish","text":"Swims against the current – and becomes golden.","prompt":"Where have you kept going against the current?"},{"title":"Ladybug","text":"Luck and little blessings.","prompt":"Name a little blessing from today."},{"title":"Penguin","text":"Together through the cold – nobody stands alone.","prompt":"Waddle like a penguin to the person on your left and give a high five!"},{"title":"Panda","text":"Peace, balance and a gentle heart.","prompt":"What brings you inner peace?"},{"title":"Peacock","text":"Show your true colours!","prompt":"Tell everyone one talent you have."},{"title":"Frog","text":"Transformation – from tadpole to frog. You can start anew.","prompt":"Jump once like a frog! What would you love to begin?"},{"title":"Snake","text":"Sheds its old skin – leave old patterns behind.","prompt":"Which old habit would you like to shed?"},{"title":"Chameleon","text":"Adapts to every change and keeps growing.","prompt":"How did you adapt to a change lately?"},{"title":"Seal","text":"Playful, light-hearted and joyful.","prompt":"Clap like a seal – everyone joins in!"},{"title":"Tiger","text":"Passion, power and determination.","prompt":"Give your best tiger roar – what is your goal?"}],"crystals":[{"title":"Your Inner Crystal","hex":"#c8b8f0","text":"Within you is a pure, sparkling crystal. One single ray of light – and it shines in every colour.","prompt":"Which colour is your light shining today? Everyone says theirs!"},{"title":"Clear Quartz","hex":"#e8f0f4","text":"Clarity – it amplifies your light.","prompt":"Say your clearest wish in one sentence."},{"title":"Smoky Quartz","hex":"#7a6a5a","text":"Turns heavy energy into calm.","prompt":"Shake out your hands – let the stress go!"},{"title":"Selenite","hex":"#f6f4ee","text":"Cleanses your space and mind.","prompt":"Take one deep, cleansing breath together."},{"title":"Black Tourmaline","hex":"#222226","text":"Protection and grounding.","prompt":"Imagine a shield of light around you."},{"title":"Labradorite","hex":"#5a7a8a","text":"Magic and transformation.","prompt":"What limit are you ready to grow beyond?"},{"title":"Fluorite","hex":"#8ac0a8","text":"Focus and a clear mind.","prompt":"Name your one priority for tomorrow."},{"title":"Hematite","hex":"#5a5a62","text":"Balance of body, mind and spirit.","prompt":"Stand on one leg for five seconds – find your balance!"},{"title":"Pyrite","hex":"#c8a84a","text":"Willpower – fool’s gold with a true heart.","prompt":"What do you really want – and will you go for it?"},{"title":"Jade","hex":"#4aa87a","text":"Harmony and prosperity.","prompt":"What brings harmony to your home?"},{"title":"Malachite","hex":"#1f8a5a","text":"Deep change – release old patterns.","prompt":"Which old pattern is ready to go?"},{"title":"Garnet","hex":"#8a1a2a","text":"Fresh energy and commitment.","prompt":"What are you fully committed to?"},{"title":"Aquamarine","hex":"#7ac8d8","text":"Calm like the sea.","prompt":"Make the sound of the waves – everyone together."},{"title":"Rhodonite","hex":"#d0607a","text":"Forgiveness and healing.","prompt":"Send a kind thought to someone you forgive."},{"title":"Amazonite","hex":"#5ac0b0","text":"Hope – the stone of hope.","prompt":"What gives you hope right now?"},{"title":"Sunstone","hex":"#f0903a","text":"Your inner sun.","prompt":"Smile your brightest smile at the group!"},{"title":"Peridot","hex":"#a8c83a","text":"Renewal and abundance.","prompt":"What new beginning is waiting for you?"},{"title":"Angelite","hex":"#a8c0e0","text":"Peace and a line to the angels.","prompt":"Ask your angel one quiet question."},{"title":"Sodalite","hex":"#2a4a9a","text":"Calm thoughts in chaos.","prompt":"What helps you think clearly?"},{"title":"Jasper","hex":"#b04a2a","text":"Comfort and resilience.","prompt":"Who is your rock in hard times?"},{"title":"Rhodochrosite","hex":"#e07a8a","text":"Self-love and new beginnings.","prompt":"Say: “I love and accept myself.”"}],"quotes":["Every sunrise is a new chance to shine.","Small steps can lead to big transformations.","Every moment is a fresh beginning.","Your journey is unique – celebrate every step.","Trust the process, even when you don’t understand it.","Live boldly, laugh freely, love deeply.","Keep moving forward, no matter the pace.","Let go of what no longer serves you.","Choose joy today.","Embrace the uncertainty – it is the canvas of possibility.","Start the day with a smile and a grateful heart.","Be the energy that uplifts others.","In every moment, choose hope over fear.","Progress, not perfection.","Your inner fire burns bright – never let it dim.","Inspiration is all around you – open your heart.","With every breath you shape your path.","Let your heart be your guide and your soul your compass.","Focus on what you can change, and let go of the rest.","Cherish this moment.","⏰ Little reminder: AM I WALKING ON MY PATH?","⏰ Pause for a second: AM I WALKING ON MY PATH?"],"wheel":[{"name":"Quietness","col":"#7ab8d8","task":"A time of quietness. Close your eyes for ten seconds and just listen.","effect":"rest"},{"name":"Impulse","col":"#f6cf2a","task":"An impulse arrives! Say the very first idea that pops into your head.","effect":"walk2"},{"name":"Create","col":"#f07a2a","task":"Time to create: invent a tiny sound or gesture – everyone copies it!","effect":"lucky"},{"name":"Overcome","col":"#3fae5a","task":"Time to overcome: name one obstacle you have already mastered.","effect":"fly3"},{"name":"Celebrate","col":"#e02aa0","task":"Finish and celebrate! Be proud of something – everyone cheers for you.","effect":"allPearl"},{"name":"Remember","col":"#7d4fb3","task":"Remember the day you decided to follow your own path. Tell us about it.","effect":"coin"}],"onwords":[{"word":"Action","text":"Nature grows in cycles. First listen to your soul – then act out of love.","prompt":"Stand up and stretch – what loving action will you take today?","effect":"walk2"},{"word":"Collection","text":"Some collect things. Collect soulmates and soul wisdom instead – your collection of pearls.","prompt":"Name one golden moment in your collection.","effect":"coin"},{"word":"Creation","text":"You are a unique creation of the Source – made to experience every facet of life.","prompt":"What makes you unique?","effect":"walk2"},{"word":"Distraction","text":"The outer world is loud. Step into stillness, release the distractions and sink into your heart.","prompt":"Everyone puts their phone away for the next round!","effect":"rest"},{"word":"Exploration","text":"You are here to explore. Life is an adventure: breathe, step forward, explore.","prompt":"What would you love to explore next?","effect":"fly3"},{"word":"Lesson","text":"Life’s great lesson is simple: BE. Be love. Be yourself – unique and authentic.","prompt":"Finish the sentence: “Today I am …”","effect":"insight"},{"word":"Inspiration","text":"You know that flash of energy – the first spark to write, paint or walk a new way.","prompt":"When did a spark of inspiration surprise you?","effect":"lucky"},{"word":"Limitation","text":"School taught us boxes and triangles. Step outside the old thought – you are limitless.","prompt":"Which limit are you ready to step beyond?","effect":"fly3"},{"word":"Passion","text":"A deep inner fire brings out your gifts – whether others understand it or not.","prompt":"What is your inner fire?","effect":"walk2"},{"word":"Reflection","text":"What you send out, you feel within. You are a golden chalice – receive, reflect, give.","prompt":"What would you like to send out into the world?","effect":"allPearl"},{"word":"Separation","text":"Separation is far from what we are. Only in human form can we forget that we are one.","prompt":"Hold hands for a moment – feel that we are one.","effect":"allForward"},{"word":"Tension","text":"Tension shows where something wants to be released. Change is a chance.","prompt":"Shrug your shoulders up – and let them drop. Ahh!","effect":"energy"},{"word":"Transformation","text":"There is always a point in life where you know: life has more to offer. Go with the change.","prompt":"What is transforming in your life right now?","effect":"lift5"},{"word":"Recognition","text":"Recognise your gifts – and the gifts in others.","prompt":"Tell the person on your right one gift you see in them.","effect":"cardinal"},{"word":"Observation","text":"Watch, notice, observe. Signs are everywhere when you are present.","prompt":"Look around: name three things you never noticed here before.","effect":"insight"},{"word":"Direction","text":"Your heart knows the direction. Every step can be a new one.","prompt":"Point to where your heart wants to go next!","effect":"walk2"},{"word":"Comparison","text":"Comparing steals your joy. Your path is unique – no one walks it like you.","prompt":"Say: “My path is my own, and it is beautiful.”","effect":"coin"},{"word":"Expression","text":"We are an expression of the universe – here to express love and joy like a child.","prompt":"Express your mood right now with one sound!","effect":"allPearl"},{"word":"Transition","text":"Passing is a beautiful thing – a transition, like the caterpillar becoming a butterfly.","prompt":"What transition in your life became a gift?","effect":"fly3"},{"word":"Mission","text":"Your mission: bring your light into the world and shine like the sun.","prompt":"In one sentence: what is your mission?","effect":"lift5"},{"word":"Motivation","text":"When you shift your energy daily, you motivate and inspire everyone around you.","prompt":"Give the group a little pep talk – three words!","effect":"allForward"},{"word":"Conversation","text":"A true conversation happens heart to heart – speaking and listening.","prompt":"Ask someone a question you have always wanted to ask.","effect":"cardinal"},{"word":"Initiation","text":"Every courageous step is a small initiation into a new part of you.","prompt":"Which new beginning are you ready to step into?","effect":"walk2"},{"word":"Imagination","text":"Invite imagination – and create a happy, joyful life.","prompt":"Imagine your perfect day and describe it in three words.","effect":"lucky"},{"word":"Communication","text":"Share lovely messages – by drawing, writing, talking.","prompt":"Send someone a kind message today (after the game!).","effect":"bring"},{"word":"Intuition","text":"Your intuition is the first thing to explore. Trust that quiet knowing.","prompt":"Close your eyes: guess a number from 1 to 6 – then walk it!","effect":"lucky"},{"word":"Rejuvenation","text":"Focus on rejuvenation: rest, play and laughter make you young again.","prompt":"Laugh out loud together for five seconds!","effect":"energy"},{"word":"Purification","text":"Imagine standing in a golden beam of light that flows through you and makes you clear.","prompt":"Breathe in golden light – breathe out everything heavy.","effect":"energy"},{"word":"Devotion","text":"When your soul sings, follow it with a pure heart. That is devotion.","prompt":"When did your soul last sing?","effect":"coin"},{"word":"Congregation","text":"Walk side by side with like-hearted people – inspired, supported, embraced.","prompt":"Where do you feel embraced by a community?","effect":"allPearl"},{"word":"Cooperation","text":"Together you bring out the best in each other.","prompt":"Build a tower of hands with everyone at the table!","effect":"allForward"},{"word":"Celebration","text":"Celebrate your Self. Celebrate your human life!","prompt":"Everyone: a little celebration dance – right now!","effect":"allPearl"},{"word":"Dedication","text":"Dedicate yourself to what you love – one step at a time.","prompt":"What do you want to dedicate more time to?","effect":"walk2"},{"word":"Manifestation","text":"Speak your wish into reality – as if it were already true.","prompt":"Say it now: “I am …”","effect":"coin"},{"word":"Appreciation","text":"Be thankful for your body, your loved ones, rain drops, snow, sun and wind.","prompt":"Name three things you appreciate right now.","effect":"allPearl"},{"word":"Liberation","text":"Free yourself from expectations. Spread your wings and free your Self.","prompt":"Shake your whole body – shake off what holds you back!","effect":"fly3"},{"word":"Invitation","text":"Invite your loved ones, your guides and your angels to walk beside you.","prompt":"Whom do you invite to walk with you today?","effect":"bring"},{"word":"Meditation","text":"In stillness you remember who you really are.","prompt":"Ten seconds of silence – together.","effect":"rest"},{"word":"Compassion","text":"Meet yourself and others with the softness you long for.","prompt":"Put your hand on your heart and send compassion to someone.","effect":"energy"},{"word":"Connection","text":"Everything is connected. You are part of the golden web.","prompt":"Everyone touch the shoulder of a neighbour – feel the connection.","effect":"allForward"}],"wings2":[{"name":"Straight","col":"#f0b020","task":"Straight ahead! Your inner self knows the way.","effect":"walk2"},{"name":"Right","col":"#3fae5a","task":"A turn to the right – a new impulse lifts you forward.","effect":"fly3"},{"name":"Left","col":"#2f7fd0","task":"A turn to the left – a little detour to learn more. Step back and gather wisdom.","effect":"detour"},{"name":"Stop","col":"#7d4fb3","task":"Stop. Rest, meditate, listen to your inner voice.","effect":"rest"},{"name":"Meet","col":"#e02aa0","task":"Meet someone! Fly to a companion and walk together.","effect":"meet"},{"name":"Up","col":"#2ac0d8","task":"Up! Uplift yourself – and without a word you uplift everyone around you.","effect":"allForward"}],"initiation":"Take a breath.\nNot to prepare — but to arrive.\n\nYou are standing at a threshold.\nBehind you lies what you know.\nBefore you, a path that cannot be mapped.\n\nThis is the Golden Path.\nIt does not promise ease.\nIt promises truth.\n\nYou do not enter because you are ready.\nYou enter because something in you remembers.\n\nStep forward with empty hands.\nWhat you cling to cannot pass with you.\nWhat is essential already walks inside you.\n\nThe forest may darken.\nThe way may twist.\nIf fear appears, do not turn away.\nWhat rises to meet you is not your enemy —\nit is the guardian of your becoming.\n\nWhen the path asks you to pause, pause.\nWhen it asks you to rest, rest.\nNot all movement is forward.\nSome steps descend inward,\nwhere the old self loosens its grip.\n\nIf a helper appears, receive without grasping.\nIf silence comes, listen without forcing meaning.\nThe Golden Path speaks softly —\nthrough sensation, timing, and truth felt in the heart.\n\nOne day you will notice:\nthe path is no longer outside you.\nEach choice has become a page.\nEach step, a line of living wisdom.\n\nWhen you reach the place of remembering,\ndo not build a throne.\nPlace a hand on your heart.\n\nThis is the Golden Heart:\nnot above others,\nnot apart from the world,\nbut present, steady, and awake.\n\nYou are not finished.\nYou are unfolding.\n\nWalk gently now.\nOthers will recognize the light in your steps\nand remember their own.\n\nThe Golden Path continues\nwherever you walk in truth.\n\nBegin.","laws":[{"title":"Law of Divine Oneness","text":"Nothing is separate. Everything is connected.","prompt":"Where do you feel connected to everything today?","effect":"allPearl"},{"title":"Law of Detachment","text":"Release opens the way. What you hold too tightly cannot walk with you.","prompt":"What can you loosen your grip on?","effect":"detourLight"},{"title":"Law of Polarity","text":"Opposites teach wholeness – light and shadow, rest and movement.","prompt":"What did a hard time teach you about joy?","effect":"insight"},{"title":"Law of Rhythm","text":"Everything moves in cycles. Timing is intelligence.","prompt":"Where are you resisting a natural pause?","effect":"rest"},{"title":"Law of Cause and Effect","text":"Who you are shapes what happens. Being shapes outcome.","prompt":"What kind seed will you plant today?","effect":"walk2"},{"title":"Law of Correspondence","text":"As within, so without. As above, so below.","prompt":"What in your outer life reflects your inner life?","effect":"insight"},{"title":"Law of Inspired Action","text":"Aligned action flows. First listen – then move.","prompt":"What is the one inspired step you feel drawn to?","effect":"fly3"}],"gateBlessings":["May you recognize the moment your soul remembers why it came.","May silence open the door through which truth gently enters.","May every lesson refine you into the gold you already are.","May you rest in divine timing and release the need to hurry.","May the ground beneath you restore your strength and belonging.","May all that no longer serves you fall away with grace.","May your open heart be filled with luminous divine energy.","May sound and vibration realign you with sacred harmony.","May your inner wisdom rise and guide your every step.","May the light you share return to you multiplied.","May you remember the innocence and wonder of your first breath.","May your journey become a blessing for many.","May you walk as the living embodiment of light and love."],"archMantra":{"seeker":"I follow the call of my soul.","healer":"My calm is healing.","creator":"I create blessing fields.","guide":"I show the way through my being."},"hidden":"At first we believe we are searching for the path.\nWe learn. We listen. We grow.\n\nBut one day a deeper realization appears:\nthe path was never outside us.\nThe wisdom we were seeking was already alive within.\n\nWe are not only travelers on the Golden Path.\nWe are part of the path itself.\n\nEvery act of kindness, every moment of courage,\nevery choice to live with awareness and love\ncreates light in the world.\n\nThe light you were searching for\nhas always been shining through you.\n\nWalk gently. Walk bravely.\nWherever you go, the Golden Path begins again."};
